b.com/users/gpbsumido/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gpbsumido","id":98932482,"login":"gpbsumido","node_id":"U_kgDOBeWXAg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commits/80eb318dac4b7874f45f0606262b49b82a46c034/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T20:18:21Z","email":"gpbsumido@gmail.com","name":"gpbsumido"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T20:18:21Z","email":"gpbsumido@gmail.com","name":"gpbsumido"},"message":"Give the work-portfolio demos a light mode\n\nThe demos hardcoded a near-black root and painted white overlays that assumed a dark backdrop, so they stayed dark on the light page while the chrome went light. Drive their surface from a new theme-aware --wp-surface on DemoStage (the project accent mixed into the page background: a light accent tint in light mode, a dark one in dark), point the ten hardcoded roots at it, and sweep the bg-white/border-white overlays to the foreground token so they darken on light and lighten on dark. The retro-arcade game demo keeps its intentional dark. Verified admin-suite, chart-library and campaign-manager in light; the 163 work-portfolio tests still pass.","tree":{"sha":"10de1b4b90c75d13681c5176782d3f7831231b9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/git/trees/10de1b4b90c75d13681c5176782d3f7831231b9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/git/commits/80eb318dac4b7874f45f0606262b49b82a46c034","verification":{"payload":null