/api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commit/0fa21e5a72a5178f7495246a781e8dc7f849bdf9","node_id":"C_kwDOUqQ3XdoAKDBmYTIxZTVhNzJhNTE3OGY3NDk1MjQ2YTc4MWU4ZGM3Zjg0OWJkZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commit/4c397a6a2df3d1760957a9d98147de85ceecd6ad","sha":"4c397a6a2df3d1760957a9d98147de85ceecd6ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commits/4c397a6a2df3d1760957a9d98147de85ceecd6ad"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commit/b7b3589edd1b04efe4d6db78d17065fcaf08922e","sha":"b7b3589edd1b04efe4d6db78d17065fcaf08922e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commits/b7b3589edd1b04efe4d6db78d17065fcaf08922e"}],"sha":"0fa21e5a72a5178f7495246a781e8dc7f849bdf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commits/0fa21e5a72a5178f7495246a781e8dc7f849bdf9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98932482?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gpbsumido","id":98932482,"login":"gpbsumido","node_id":"U_kgDOBeWXAg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commits/b7b3589edd1b04efe4d6db78d17065fcaf08922e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T15:28:18Z","email":"gpbsumido@gmail.com","name":"gpbsumido"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T15:28:18Z","email":"gpbsumido@gmail.com","name":"gpbsumido"},"message":"Derive the work-portfolio counts instead of writing them down\n\nThe server page reads the catalog and hands the numbers to the write-up\nas props, so the prose counts itself. The metadata description is a\ntemplate literal over the same arrays.\n\nProps rather than importing the catalog in the write-up: that component\nis \"use client\", so importing it there would put 21KB of catalog in the\nroute''s bundle to render two integers. The server page pays nothing.\n\nfeatureData.data.ts keeps its literal and keeps the guard. It feeds the\ncommand palette registry, which sits in the root layout, so importing\nthe catalog there would put it in every route in the app. That is the\nmistake featureDataImports.test.ts already exists to stop.\n\nThe launch figures stay literal too. Deriving history would make it a lie.\n\nVerified on a production build, not just the sources: the route''s HTML\nrenders 22 and 10, its meta description reads 22 and 10, and neither the\ncatalog chunk nor any catalog string appears in it. The probe string is\npresent in .next/server and in /work-portfolio''s own client chunk, so its\nabsence here means something.","tree":{"sha":"154a0b7728ba6702550863c61816f771cb7ac9d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/git/trees/154a0b7728ba6702550863c61816f771cb7ac9d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/git/commits/b7b3589edd1b04efe4d6db78d17065fcaf08922e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98932482?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gpbsumido","id":98932482,"login":"gpbsumido","node_id":"U_kgDOBeWXAg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commit/b7b3589edd1b04efe4d6db78d17065fcaf08922e","node_id":"C_kwDOUqQ3XdoAKGI3YjM1ODllZGQxYjA0ZWZlNGQ2ZGI3OGQxNzA2NWZjYWYwODkyMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commit/cad4ac5c7e25877a3c113dee3f69cb731431810a","sha":"cad4ac5c7e25877a3c113dee3f69cb731431810a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commits/cad4ac5c7e25877a3c113dee3f69cb731431810a"}],"sha":"b7b3589edd1b04efe4d6db78d17065fcaf08922e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commits/b7b3589edd1b04efe4d6db78d17065fcaf08922e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98932482?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gpbsumido","id":98932482,"login":"gpbsumido","node_id":"U_kgDOBeWXAg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commits/cad4ac5c7e25877a3c113dee3f69cb731431810a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T14:42:35Z","email":"gpbsumido@gmail.com","name":"gpbsumido"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T14:42:35Z","email":"gpbsumido@gmail.com","name":"gpbsumido"},"message":"Correct the work-portfolio counts\n\n22 feature demos across 10 projects, not 24 across 11. Fixed in the\npage metadata, the thoughts registry preview, the write-up intro, the\nlazy-loading bullet and the two type docs.\n\nThe catalog bullet now says what moved and why, rather than quietly\nrestating a different number: Economy & Financial Health overlapped the\nother analytics demos, and Streaming Ops went out with the Ops Console\nproject it was the only demo for.\n\nTwo places lost the number instead of gaining a new one. The PR-splitting\nline and the ComingSoonDemo line were making a point about approach that\nthe count was incidental to, so they cannot drift again.","tree":{"sha":"60132124c2a14b896743f9908d04bf95bce972ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/git/trees/60132124c2a14b896743f9908d04bf95bce972ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/git/commits/cad4ac5c7e25877a3c113dee3f69cb731431810a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98932482?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gpbsumido","id":98932482,"login":"gpbsumido","node_id":"U_kgDOBeWXAg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpbsumido","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commit/cad4ac5c7e25877a3c113dee3f69cb731431810a","node_id":"C_kwDOUqQ3XdoAKGNhZDRhYzVjN2UyNTg3N2EzYzExM2RlZTNmNjljYjczMTQzMTgxMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commit/abb65103e58729d281667800bd996429da875c9c","sha":"abb65103e58729d281667800bd996429da875c9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpbsumido/work-portfolio-mfe/commits/abb65103e58729d2816678