s/Batzorig11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Batzorig11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-content/commits/41ce558eb422365ca9431c6d0b71303224f64c6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T07:28:11Z","email":"102161104+Batzorig11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Batzorig"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T07:28:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(cms): scheduled publishing worker, editor autosave/guard, author filter, SEO fields, duplicate post (#8601)\n\n* feat(cms): scheduled publishing worker, editor autosave/guard, author filter, SEO fields, duplicate post\n\n- Add BullMQ worker to content_api that publishes scheduled posts and\n  archives posts past autoArchiveDate (per-org dispatch in saas mode)\n- Add unsaved-changes guard (router blocker + beforeunload) and debounced\n  silent autosave for draft posts in the post editor\n- Add author filter to posts list (expose authorId on cmsPostList)\n- Add per-post seoTitle/seoDescription with SEO accordion in post form\n- Add duplicate post action (model method, mutation, row action;\n  copies translations, resets to draft with fresh slug)\n- Remove dead TranslationEditor component and unused CMS_ADD_TRANSLATION\n- Add en/mn locale keys and manual testing plan\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in 046b7e8 according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/8601\n\n* chore: remove test plan doc from PR\n\n* fix: resolve DeepSource issues\n\n- Prefix intentionally discarded destructured fields with underscore and\n  drop the any cast in Posts.duplicatePost\n- Type the worker redis connection param instead of any\n- Extract post form value builders to reduce reset effect complexity\n- Use explicit undefined return in autosave effect guard\n- Add documentation comments to flagged functions\n\n* fix: resolve remaining DeepSource issues\n\n- Use Boolean() casts instead of double negation in form value builders\n- Add documentation comments to the unsaved-changes guard hook/component\n  and duplicate post helpers\n\n* fix: replace explicit any types in PR-touched files\n\n- Type getPosts query/sort with mongoose FilterQuery/SortOrder\n- Type post mutation translation inputs via ITranslation\n- Type AddPostForm editingPost/location state/onFormReady contract\n  with FieldValues instead of any (align both post pages and\n  AddPostHeaderActions on the same contract)\n- Cast loaded cmsPost to TLoadedPost instead of any\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in ff98ced according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/8601\n\n* fix: address CodeRabbit review findings\n\n- Require read access to the source document before duplicating a post\n- Await scheduled-post queue dispatches so failures surface in the job\n\n* fix: await lean query in getPosts to satisfy require-await\n\n* feat(cms): fall back to post title/excerpt for empty SEO fields\n\n* fix: address SonarCloud findings (readonly statics, redundant undefined, deprecated returnValue)\n\n* fix: replace any-typed translation model map with typed minimal document shape\n\n* fix: type post custom resolver params instead of any\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in e61200c according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/8601\n\n* fix(cms): refresh custom fields and clear archive date\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in ce6ea4d according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/8601\n\n* fix: address PR #8601 review (round 1)\n\nAdd documentation comments required by DeepSource for the new synchronization and auto-archive helpers.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: deepsource-autofix[bot] <62050782+deepsource-autofix[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a180db07ce353f3b9cedcbfa5760bcb9416fa70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-content/git/trees/6a180db07ce353f3b9cedcbfa5760bcb9416fa70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-content/git/commits/41ce558eb422365ca9431c6d0b71303224f64c6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-content/commit/41ce558eb422365ca9431c6d0b71303224f64c6e","node_id":"C_kwDOUq-Yz9oAKDQxY2U1NThlYjQyMjM2NWNhOTQzMWM2ZDBiNzEzMDMyMjRmNjRjNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-content/commit/bda450734b53152ee497eb8d5aef2af4c00d9586","sha":"bda450734b53152ee497eb8d5aef2af4c00d9586","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-content/commits/bda450734b53152ee497eb8d5aef2af4c00d9586"}],"sha":"41ce558eb422365ca9431c6d0b7130