i.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-frontline/commits/0e07b574155915789f91f6e8ab667c0b2d9dd1ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T15:44:18Z","email":"104069564+Wlkr123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuguldur"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T15:44:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(frontline): Facebook comment reply outbox, variants and breaker (#9276)\n\n* feat: fb comment defer\n\n* feat: Enhance Facebook Bot Automation Features\n\n- Added `mentionSender` option to comment action form schema for tagging senders in replies.\n- Refactored `AutomationFbBotFormContent` to use tabs for better organization of settings and activity.\n- Introduced `FacebookBotCommentActivity` component to display comment reply statistics and delivery status.\n- Updated `FacebookBotAutomations` to show connected automations with their respective trigger types.\n- Implemented dropdown menu for creating automations from messages or comments in `FacebookBotCreateAutomationButton`.\n- Removed `FacebookBotHealthPanel` and replaced it with `FacebookBotProfileHealth` for better clarity on Messenger profile status.\n- Created `FacebookBotSettingsTab` for managing persistent menus and ice breakers in a collapsible format.\n- Added hooks for fetching comment reply statistics and updated related components accordingly.\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in f2f4c9f according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/9276\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: deepsource-autofix[bot] <62050782+deepsource-autofix[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6bf03c989787b47a7cb9714eaf67c1f4a817be36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-frontline/git/trees/6bf03c989787b47a7cb9714eaf67c1f4a817be36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-frontline/git/commits/0e07b574155915789f91f6e8ab667c0b2d9dd1ea"