y.\n- Enhanced FieldLabel component to include validation messages and improved required field handling.\n- Introduced drag-and-drop functionality for managing property rows in MultipleFieldsInGroup.\n- Added utility functions for parsing property data keys and validating field values.\n- Updated PropertiesFilter to support new row grouping logic and improved condition handling.","tree":{"sha":"d9ae68d30fbea194c81cafc861fc0639c0240dd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-frontline/git/trees/d9ae68d30fbea194c81cafc861fc0639c0240dd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-frontline/git/commits/44b1753f5e9d290ac86b1845e7005fff28977cfd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104069564?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Wlkr123","id":104069564,"login":"Wlkr123","node_id":"U_kgDOBjP5vA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-frontline/commit/44b1753f5e9d290ac86b1845e7005fff28977cfd","node_id":"C_kwDOUq-abNoAKDQ0YjE3NTNmNWU5ZDI5MGFjODZiMTg0NWU3MDA1ZmZmMjg5NzdjZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-frontline/commit/dee5d263e1543030540602ac2f0456ea9d2f9e1e","sha":"dee5d263e1543030540602ac2f0456ea9d2f9e1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-frontline/commits/dee5d263e1543030540602ac2f0456ea9d2f9e1e"}],"sha":"44b1753f5e9d290ac86b1845e7005fff28977cfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-frontline/commits/44b1753f5e9d290ac86b1845e7005fff28977cfd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104069564?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Wlkr123","id":104069564,"login":"Wlkr123","node_id":"U_kgDOBjP5vA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-frontline/commits/dee5d263e1543030540602ac2f0456ea9d2f9e1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T03:42:36Z","email":"104069564+Wlkr123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuguldur"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T03:42:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"enhance: segment management with new hooks and functionalities (#9217)\n\n* feat(segments): add hooks for segment property types and save guard\n\n- Implemented `useSegmentPropertyTypes` to fetch and manage segment property types based on content type.\n- Created `useSegmentSaveGuard` to handle save operations, checking for duplicates and pending rebuilds.\n- Updated `useSegmentStats` to streamline statistics calculation for segments.\n- Enhanced `useSelectSegments` to support content type as a prop.\n- Introduced `segmentFormSchema` for validating segment forms using Zod.\n- Refactored segment types and utilities for better organization and clarity.\n- Added a new script for seeding deals in the database for benchmarking purposes.\n\n* feat(segments): enhance segment management with new hooks and functionalities\n\n- Implemented useSegmentLabels for dynamic label translations based on content type.\n- Added useSegmentNodeValue to manage segment node values in forms.\n- Introduced useSegmentRebuild for rebuilding segments with error handling and notifications.\n- Created useSegmentTreeDnd for drag-and-drop functionality in segment trees.\n- Developed useSegmentTreeSteps for managing navigation through segment tree nodes.\n- Enhanced useSegmentStats to calculate and track segment statistics more efficiently.\n- Added useSelectSegments for improved segment selection with search capabilities.\n- Updated segment form schema to include visibility options and segment references.\n- Introduced segmentFormDirtyAtom for managing form dirty state.\n- Refactored segment node types to support new segment reference nodes.\n- Added utility functions for segment tree manipulation, including moving nodes and pruning empty groups.\n- Updated various hooks to improve performance and usability in segment management.\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in 9e495b0 according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/9217\n\n* Refactor segment-related files and queries\n\n- Deleted obsolete MongoDB measurement and event-driven segmentation plan files.\n- Updated GraphQL query name from `Segments` to `SegmentList` for clarity.\n\n* refactor: remove revert selectivity and ecommerce segment configurations\n\n- Deleted the revertSelectivity utility to streamline the revert capture process.\n- Removed ecommerceSegmentConfigs and related ecommerce segments logic to simplify the ecommerce module.\n- Eliminated LogRevertPanel and RevertConflictResolver components to enhance the logs UI.\n- Removed GraphQL mutations and queries related to the revert process to clean up the codebase.\n- Deleted hooks and utility functions associated with the revert functionality for better maintainability.\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in 740e2fe according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/9217\n\n* Refactor GraphQL queries and components to remove unused segmentData parameter\n\n- Updated multiple GraphQL queries across various modules to eliminate the segmentData parameter, ensuring cleaner and more efficient queries.\n- Enhanced SelectSegment component to handle unnamed segments with a default label.\n- Modified segment form schema to conditionally require the name field based on ownership.\n- Adjusted hooks and context providers to accommodate changes in segment ownership handling.\n- Improved error handling in activity and ticket hooks to prevent crashes on undefined data.","tree":{"sha":"ae5c7375145d7b99d16ce03dccc3541d75cf84b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-frontline/git/trees/ae5c7375145d7b99d16ce03dccc3541d75cf84b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-frontline/git/commits/dee5d263e1543030540602ac2f0456ea9d2f9e1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}"