ubscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/commits/b344a6a8809ee34265e0a6a80944df5371823444/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T14:08:58Z","email":"104069564+Wlkr123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuguldur"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T14:08:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: enhance Facebook bot automation, email template placeholders, and placeholder input type safety (#8170)\n\n* feat: enhance Facebook bot automation with new fields and improved comment trigger functionality\n\n- Added handoffMessage, automationActiveMessage, and handoffPauseMinutes fields to Facebook bot mutations and queries.\n- Updated Facebook bot form schema to include new fields for handoff and automation messages.\n- Removed obsolete CommentTriggerFilters component and integrated its functionality into CommentTriggerForm.\n- Enhanced comment trigger form to support new conditions and validation messages.\n- Improved trigger configuration summary to handle comment and message conditions separately.\n- Introduced new hooks for managing automated reply control in conversations.\n- Added FacebookMessageRelationNotice component for displaying message relations in the UI.\n- Implemented FacebookMediaMessage component for handling media messages in reply actions.\n- Created FacebookPersistentMenuGenerator for managing persistent menus with drag-and-drop functionality.\n\n* feat: add email template image upload functionality and document placeholder support\n\n- Implemented image upload functionality in EmailTemplateForm with API integration.\n- Enhanced BlockEditor to support additional slash menu items for document placeholders.\n- Created EmailDocumentPlaceholderPicker for selecting documents to insert as placeholders.\n- Added DocumentPlaceholderBlock to render document placeholders in the editor.\n- Updated Facebook bot components to improve account and page selection logic.\n- Refactored SalesRemoteEntry to link directly to customer details.\n- Introduced renderEmailContent function to handle email content rendering with inline styles and image normalization.\n\n* Refactor Placeholder Input Suggestions and Update AI Agent Configuration\n\n- Introduced a new type system for placeholder input suggestions, replacing string literals with an enum for better type safety and maintainability.\n- Updated the AI agent configuration form to handle legacy input mapping and introduced a new input field for custom inputs.\n- Modified various components to utilize the new placeholder input suggestion types, ensuring consistent usage across the application.\n- Enhanced the AI agent runtime summary to accommodate changes in input handling and improved warning messages for users.\n- Refactored related utility functions and hooks to align with the new type definitions and ensure proper functionality.\n\n* fix: update export statements for TPlaceholderInputSuggestion and related types","tree":{"sha":"94fdf178f6edb9ef98bd7f79622984f191ae6d72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/git/trees/94fdf178f6edb9ef98bd7f79622984f191ae6d72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/git/commits/b344a6a8809ee34265e0a6a80944df5371823444","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":198