/users/Wlkr123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Wlkr123","id":104069564,"login":"Wlkr123","node_id":"U_kgDOBjP5vA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/commit/2faecc79c702b48b3acdeb920a2fede34950db3d","node_id":"C_kwDOUq-cBNoAKDJmYWVjYzc5YzcwMmI0OGIzYWNkZWI5MjBhMmZlZGUzNDk1MGRiM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/commit/6c07b06b957a49ec69540e6b85399b63c5bfffb9","sha":"6c07b06b957a49ec69540e6b85399b63c5bfffb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/commits/6c07b06b957a49ec69540e6b85399b63c5bfffb9"}],"sha":"2faecc79c702b48b3acdeb920a2fede34950db3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/commits/2faecc79c702b48b3acdeb920a2fede34950db3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104069564?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Wlkr123","id":104069564,"login":"Wlkr123","node_id":"U_kgDOBjP5vA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/commits/6c07b06b957a49ec69540e6b85399b63c5bfffb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T11:23:19Z","email":"104069564+Wlkr123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuguldur"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T11:23:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(automations): add loyalty actions, flow direction support, and automation builder enhancements (#7952)\n\n* feat: add TransformNodeContent component and transform form schema\n\n- Introduced TransformNodeContent component to display output mappings.\n- Created transformForm schema using zod for validation of mappings.\n- Updated PlaceHolderNode to fit view on selection and improved structure.\n- Modified AutomationBuilderSidebar to handle editing state for actions only.\n- Enhanced AutomationNodeLibrarySidebar with action group filtering and grouping.\n- Implemented utility functions for action grouping and filtering.\n- Added AutomationButtonPermissionFallback for permission handling.\n- Integrated unsaved changes alert for automation builder with segment management.\n- Updated rspack configuration files to apply watch options for better performance.\n\n* feat: Enhance automation builder with flow direction support and new loyalty actions\n\n- Added flow direction parameter to node generation functions for horizontal and vertical layouts.\n- Updated node positioning logic to accommodate flow direction changes.\n- Introduced new loyalty automation components including action configuration forms and node content.\n- Implemented score adjustment actions with forms for adding and subtracting scores.\n- Integrated new icons for loyalty actions and updated module federation configuration.\n- Updated dependencies to ensure compatibility with the latest features.\n\n* Refactor automation components and improve error handling\n\n- Renamed LoadingSkeleton component to SidebarNodeLibrarySkeleton for clarity.\n- Removed TabContentWrapper component as it was no longer needed.\n- Updated AutomationVariableBrowser to use a single merged property source instead of an array.\n- Modified AutomationVariableBrowserTypes to reflect changes in property sources.\n- Enhanced AutomationOutputPropertySourceFields to correctly handle field keys.\n- Adjusted AutomationOutputVariableList to prioritize inline reference fields.\n- Refactored useAutomationNodeOutput hook to streamline property source handling and added support for incoming webhook reference variables.\n- Introduced AutomationNodeLibraryProvider for better context management in the sidebar.\n- Created useAutomationNodeLibraryGroups hook to manage action and trigger groups.\n- Added AutomationErrorState component for improved error display and handling.\n- Updated RenderPluginsComponentWrapper to utilize the new AutomationErrorState component.\n- Implemented useAutomationBuilderStatusSwitcher for managing automation status changes.\n- Enhanced useAutomationNodes hook to include an isEmpty utility function.\n- Adjusted useReactFlowEditor to ensure proper node addition and connection handling.\n- Updated placeholder input types and props for better flexibility and usability.\n- Corrected contentType references in deliveryConfig and syncCard components to align with new structure.\n- Updated SalesActionHistoryResultColumn to reflect new URL structure for deals.\n\n* feat: Enhance automation trigger forms and input handling\n\n- Added support for output variables in split conditions configuration.\n- Introduced isExpression property in transform configuration to handle expression types.\n- Updated validation schema to include isExpression for transform mappings.\n- Improved sidebar layout with shrink properties for better responsiveness.\n- Modified placeholder input components to include value previews for expressions.\n- Adjusted default suggestion settings for attributes in placeholder inputs.\n- Enhanced placeholder input detection with cursor snapping for locked expressions.\n- Refactored sales automation trigger forms to support stage change and probability triggers.\n- Created new components for handling sales trigger scope fields and stage selection.\n- Implemented backend logic for checking stage changes in sales automation triggers.\n\n* Refactor automation execution actions and improve placeholder replacement\n\n- Removed unnecessary console logs from AI agent knowledge indexing and health check workers.\n- Updated email payload generation to use `replaceOutputPlaceholders` for dynamic content replacement.\n- Enhanced recipient email collection to utilize the new placeholder replacement method.\n- Refactored transform action execution to streamline expression evaluation and placeholder resolution.\n- Improved outgoing webhook execution by integrating placeholder replacement for headers, URL, and body.\n- Adjusted find object action execution to utilize the new placeholder replacement method.\n- Updated property management sidebar to ensure proper property type handling.\n- Enhanced action node configuration to optimize component rendering based on action data.\n- Cleaned up variable browser and source node list components for better usability.\n- Added new GraphQL queries for automation properties and updated related hooks.\n- Improved UI components for better styling consistency across sales and loyalty modules.\n\n* feat: implement generateTotalAmount function and refactor related automation actions\n\n- Added a new utility function `generateTotalAmount` to calculate the total amount from product data.\n- Removed deprecated `getItems` and `getRelatedValue` actions to streamline automation processes.\n- Updated `salesAutomationHandlers` to utilize the new `generateTotalAmount` function.\n- Refactored `setProperty` action to include new property target handling.\n- Enhanced UI components to support new property target configurations and improved user experience.\n- Updated GraphQL queries to accommodate new source types for automation properties.\n- Improved error handling and logging in execution actions.\n\n* feat: add voucher automation producers and enhance score campaign logic\n\n- Implemented voucher automation producers for checking custom triggers and receiving actions related to voucher creation.\n- Enhanced score campaign logic to resolve expressions and calculate campaign change scores with improved placeholder resolution.\n- Added new fields and resolvers for sales reference types, including display names and exclude loyalty amounts.\n- Updated UI components for better error handling and visual consistency, including changes to error displays and loading states.\n- Refactored action target selection logic to prevent certain action types from being selectable as targets.\n- Improved automation error state presentation and added localization support for error messages.\n\n* feat: add AI agent management functionalities including add, edit, and remove actions, along with total counts query\n\n* feat: add POS order event trigger and action configuration forms\n\n- Implemented `checkPosOrderEventTrigger` to handle various POS order events.\n- Created `AwardSpinActionConfigForm` and `IssueVoucherActionConfigForm` for loyalty actions.\n- Developed `CreatePosOrderActionConfigForm` for creating POS orders with various configurations.\n- Added `PosOrderEventTriggerConfigForm` to manage event triggers related to POS orders.\n- Introduced common components like `PosOptionInput` and `PosPaymentTypeSelect` for reusability.\n- Defined schemas for form validation using Zod for both action and trigger configurations.\n- Established constants for POS order events, statuses, and types to standardize options across forms.\n\n* refactor: streamline automation owner resolution in score, spin, and voucher producers\n\n* feat(ticket-automation): add ticket automation producers, constants, and UI components\n\n- Implemented ticket automation producers for handling actions and triggers.\n- Created constants for ticket automation including output definitions and action configurations.\n- Developed utility functions for generating ticket fields based on schema and options.\n- Added segment configurations for ticket-related modules.\n- Introduced UI components for ticket action configuration, including forms for creating tickets and managing actions.\n- Established validation schemas for ticket action configurations and checklist actions.\n- Enhanced the frontend with new components for ticket automation actions and node content display.\n\n* feat: add conversation event automation trigger and UI components\n\n- Introduced constants for conversation event triggers in backend.\n- Created InboxRemoteEntry component to handle automation trigger forms.\n- Developed ConversationEventTriggerForm for configuring event triggers with conditions.\n- Implemented ConversationEventTriggerNodeContent to display selected trigger configurations.\n- Added constants and validation schemas for conversation event triggers.\n- Created CreateTicketActionResult component for displaying ticket creation results in automation actions.\n\n* feat(inbox): add automation workers and integrate inbox event handling\n\n* feat: add automation widgets for project and task actions\n\n- Implemented `CreateProjectActionConfigForm` and `CreateTaskActionConfigForm` for configuring project and task actions in automation.\n- Added `OperationActionConfigForm` to handle different action types based on the selected automation node type.\n- Introduced `OperationCompletionTriggerConfigForm` for configuring completion triggers with project and team options.\n- Created `OperationCompletionModeInput` for selecting completion modes in triggers.\n- Developed `OperationActionHistoryResult` and `OperationActionNodeContent` for displaying action results and node content in automation history.\n- Added constants and form definitions for task and project action configurations.\n- Integrated lazy loading for remote entries in `ProjectRemoteEntry`, `TaskRemoteEntry`, and `TeamRemoteEntry`.\n- Enhanced module federation configuration to include new automation widgets.\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in 4eb6ec3 according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/7952\n\n* refactor: remove applyWatchOptions from rspack configurations\n\n* refactor: remove applyWatchOptions from rspack configuration\n\n* fix: include permissions in plugin metadata\n\n* refactor: simplify automation worker functions and update imports\n\n* refactor: update fetch functions to use await for better readability\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in dd0255a according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/7952\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: deepsource-autofix[bot] <62050782+deepsource-autofix[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"78843102c9d4f8d8292740d3cb804b408bca250c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/git/trees/78843102c9d4f8d8292740d3cb804b408bca250c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/git/commits/6c07b06b957a49ec69540e6b85399b63c5bfffb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_u