n support and enhance automation components (#7648)\n\n* feat: add AI provider connection support for Cloudflare and OpenAI\n\n- Introduced new environment utility functions for AI provider configuration.\n- Created a unified resolver for AI provider connections, handling both Cloudflare and OpenAI.\n- Implemented connection forms for Cloudflare AI Gateway and OpenAI, including model selection and API key management.\n- Updated agent connection schema to support new provider configurations and validation.\n- Refactored existing components to accommodate the new structure and improve maintainability.\n- Removed deprecated utility functions and components related to cloud storage.\n\n* feat: add AI agent configuration form and variable browser components\n\n- Implemented `useAiAgentConfigForm` hook for managing AI agent configuration.\n- Created `AutomationBuilderVariablesHelpPopover` for variable help information.\n- Developed `AutomationVariableBrowser` and related components for output variable management.\n- Added types for automation variables and output properties.\n- Introduced utility functions for building variable paths and payloads.\n- Enhanced sidebar with output variable sections and source node selection.\n- Added footer for automation configuration forms and settings page shell.\n- Implemented header for automation settings detail with navigation support.\n\n* feat: Refactor segment form components and introduce SegmentGroup context\n\n- Updated PropertyOperator component to utilize SegmentGroupField context.\n- Enhanced SegmentForm to support different modes (DEFAULT, SINGLE).\n- Introduced SegmentGroup and SegmentGroupAddButton components for better condition management.\n- Refactored SegmentProperty to use SegmentGroupFieldProvider for cleaner state management.\n- Created SegmentGroupConditionsList for rendering condition properties.\n- Improved SegmentPropertiesRails and SegmentPropertiesRailsButton to work with the new context.\n- Added utility functions to handle default values based on segment form mode.\n- Updated types to accommodate new structure and functionality.\n\n* feat: Update icons and improve automation components for better clarity and functionality\n\n* refactor: clean up unused imports and improve code organization in automation components","tree":{"sha":"016f7cd8adb009106334c402b903e10f8f53ae85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/git/trees/016f7cd8adb009106334c402b903e10f8f53ae85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/git/commits/e2f867c1ae500c284801df46fd0569b35ea0162f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/commit/e2f867c1ae500c284801df46fd0569b35ea0162f","node_id":"C_kwDOUq-cBNoAKGUyZjg2N2MxYWU1MDBjMjg0ODAxZGY0NmZkMDU2OWIzNWVhMDE2MmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-loyalty/commit/a9ce8e7c02d4856a560b4daac57c54ea2e314c19","sh