s://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-operation/commits/481f243b5f9921a7a2e89b1c4c7f95a23cf67a40"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104069564?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Wlkr123","id":104069564,"login":"Wlkr123","node_id":"U_kgDOBjP5vA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-operation/commits/08372e2a65dba2b7ca2f59bc303da675e5f8bfff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T16:02:44Z","email":"104069564+Wlkr123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuguldur"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T16:02:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"enhancement(automation): add AI agent knowledge sources and output utilities (#8655)\n\n* feat: add email content editor and rendering utilities\n\n- Implemented `useSendEmailContentEditor` hook for managing email content with block editor.\n- Created `renderEmailBlocks` utility to convert BlockNote editor blocks into email-safe HTML.\n- Added types for email content structures including inline content, tables, and editor blocks.\n\nfeat: enhance automation output variable components\n\n- Introduced `AutomationOutputVariableChildList` and `AutomationOutputVariableItem` for better management of output variables.\n- Added loading and empty states for output variable lists.\n- Created context and hooks for managing automation variable selections and expansions.\n\nfeat: implement AI agent knowledge source management\n\n- Developed `AiAgentKnowledgeSourcePanel` and `AiAgentKnowledgeSourceRail` for selecting knowledge sources.\n- Added context and hooks for managing AI agent knowledge sources and their statuses.\n- Implemented utility functions for handling knowledge source selections and statuses.\n\nfeat: add session tab management and last selected AI agent kind persistence\n\n- Created `useSessionTab` hook to maintain active tab state across sessions.\n- Implemented functions to remember the last selected AI agent kind using session storage.\n\nfeat: introduce automation set property targets hook\n\n- Added `useAutomationSetPropertyTargets` hook to fetch property type options based on source type.\n\n* feat: refactor import/export configurations and enhance product data handling in sales module\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in cf1717d according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/8655\n\n* fix: correct structure of documents type in IMeta to include types array\n\n* feat: enhance automation handling by adding runtime output resolution and refactoring email date formatting\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: deepsource-autofix[bot] <62050782+deepsource-autofix[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cde8d446c30a83d183827157d884ec7adcf0f683","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-operation/git/trees/cde8d446c30a83d183827157d884ec7adcf0f683"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-operation/git/commits/08372e2a65dba2b7ca2f59bc303da675e5f8bfff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.g