rl":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Amartuvshins0404","id":65982680,"login":"Amartuvshins0404","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1OTgyNjgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-operation/commits/b24e14f3005245a6536c54f5c21c8135c7b62d43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T20:43:18Z","email":"65982680+Amartuvshins0404@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Amartuvshin Surenjav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T20:43:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Sentry error monitoring (frontend + backend) with expected-error classification (#7907)\n\n* feat: Sentry error monitoring (frontend + backend) with expected-error classification\n\nBackend (erxes-api-shared):\n- Add ExpectedError class + deterministic classifier so known business\n  conditions (auth/permission/scope/portal) are tagged EXPECTED regardless\n  of message text, instead of becoming Sentry noise.\n- Route permission/login/scope/client-portal checks through ExpectedError.\n\nFrontend (core-ui host + MF remotes):\n- initSentry() in bootstrap installs global handlers for host AND remotes;\n  DSN/env wired via DefinePlugin (rspack) and erxes-ui config getters.\n- beforeSend noise filter mirrors the backend classifier.\n- RouteErrorBoundary as the data-router errorElement captures routed render\n  errors synchronously (wrapCreateBrowserRouterV7 is tracing-only and does\n  not capture); AppErrorBoundary covers non-router React errors.\n\nFix (operation_ui):\n- TaskFields parsed description with an unguarded JSON.parse during render;\n  plain-text/legacy descriptions (e.g. API-created tasks) crashed the page.\n  Parse defensively: valid JSON -> blocks, plain text -> paragraph, never throw.\n\nDocs: .env.sample documents the SENTRY_* / REACT_APP_SENTRY_* vars.\n\n* fix(operation_ui): guard description JSON.parse in triage & project fields\n\nAddresses CodeRabbit review on PR #7907: the unguarded JSON.parse(description)\nrender crash fixed in TaskFields also existed in TriageFields and ProjectFields\n(plain-text / legacy descriptions would throw during render and crash the page).\n\nExtract the defensive parse into a shared parseDescriptionBlocks() helper and use\nit across all three components, removing the duplicated inline logic.","tree":{"sha":"95cb3643be85abf0f731d557a08a297a49b03261","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-operation/git/trees/95cb3643be85abf0f731d557a08a297a49b03261"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-operation/git/commits/b24e14f3005245a6536c54f5c21c8135c7b62d43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","no