tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-payment/commit/f409ed8ed22fc4a245fa639f576206c1650617f4","node_id":"C_kwDOUq-d8toAKGY0MDllZDhlZDIyZmM0YTI0NWZhNjM5ZjU3NjIwNmMxNjUwNjE3ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-payment/commit/764acb782868ae8ba7a1ba2fa84fdc4eb3d62cd5","sha":"764acb782868ae8ba7a1ba2fa84fdc4eb3d62cd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-payment/commits/764acb782868ae8ba7a1ba2fa84fdc4eb3d62cd5"}],"sha":"f409ed8ed22fc4a245fa639f576206c1650617f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-payment/commits/f409ed8ed22fc4a245fa639f576206c1650617f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65982680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Amartuvshins0404","id":65982680,"login":"Amartuvshins0404","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1OTgyNjgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-payment/commits/764acb782868ae8ba7a1ba2fa84fdc4eb3d62cd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T08:32:46Z","email":"65982680+Amartuvshins0404@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Amartuvshin Surenjav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T08:32:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(payment): remove clear-text logging of sensitive data in Toki API (#7452)\n\n* fix(core-api): add rate limiting to file upload and read endpoints\n\nAddresses CodeQL alert #1062 (CWE-770).\n\n* fix: resolve TS2769 type mismatch for rate limiter middleware\n\n* fix: use type assertion on req.query instead of as any for rate limiter\n\n* fix(core-api): address rate-limit review feedback\n\n- Set trust proxy to resolve client IP correctly behind gateway\n- Increase rate limits for practical usage (read: 1000, upload: 200,\n  chunk: 1000, subscription: 500 per 15min)\n- Add dedicated chunkLimiter for /upload-chunked/chunk to prevent\n  large uploads from exhausting the upload budget\n- Add rate limiting to /delete-file endpoint\n- Return structured JSON error responses on 429\n- Enable standard RateLimit-* response headers\n\n* fix(core-api): resolve DeepSource and SonarCloud review failures\n\n- Remove trust proxy setting to fix SonarCloud E security rating\n- Add explicit keyGenerator to rate limiters for IP resolution\n- Replace any types with proper types in chunk upload handler\n- Use unknown + instanceof for error handling in catch block\n\n* fix(core-api): resolve SonarCloud, DeepSource, and CodeRabbit findings\n\n- Sanitize uploadId and chunkIndex before path operations to prevent\n  path traversal (SonarCloud S5145)\n- Add explicit return at end of chunk upload handler (DeepSource JS-0045)\n- Parse width query param as number at runtime (CodeRabbit)\n- Remove trust proxy, use keyGenerator for IP resolution instead\n\n* fix(core-api): resolve DeepSource JS-0097 and JS-0045\n\n- Remove unnecessary escape on hyphen in regex character class\n- Return null instead of bare return in async arrow function\n\n* fix(core-api,gateway): resolve per-IP rate limiting behind gateway\n\n- Enable xfwd on gateway proxy so X-Forwarded-For is forwarded\n- Read rightmost XFF entry (gateway-appended, unspoofable) for rate\n  limit keying instead of req.ip which returns gateway IP\n- No trust proxy needed — avoids SonarCloud security flag\n\n* fix(core-api): address remaining review findings from PR #7365\n\n- DRY rate limiter config via createLimiter factory function\n- Add width query param validation (reject NaN/negative)\n- Fix unsafe catch-block error access with instanceof narrowing\n- Add input validation for chunked upload init endpoint\n- Rename interfaces to I-prefix convention (IUploadStatus, IReadFileQuery)\n- Inline getClientIp in main.ts to remove duplication\n- Fix unnecessary regex escape in product query\n- Add JSDoc to interfaces and helpers\n\n* fix(core-api): resolve SonarCloud security hotspots in chunked upload\n\nUse server-generated UUID (uploadInfo.uploadId) instead of user-derived\nsafeUploadId for all filesystem path construction to break the taint\nflow from req.body to fs operations.\n\nAdd GET /upload-chunked/status/:uploadId endpoint so uploadStore is\nconsumed (was flagged as written-but-never-read collection).\n\n* fix(core-api): resolve all remaining PR #7365 review comments\n\n- Read rightmost X-Forwarded-For entry to prevent IP spoofing bypass\n- Use String#replaceAll() instead of String#replace() with /g flag\n- Add chunkIndex upper bound validation against totalChunks\n- Add explicit return null for arrow functions without return value\n- Add TTL-based cleanup for abandoned chunked upload sessions\n- Type-annotate getRegex param in product similarity queries\n\n* fix(core-api,gateway): resolve DeepSource and SonarCloud gate failures\n\n- Replace any[] and any with FilterQuery<IProductDocument> in product\n  similarity queries (DeepSource JS-0323)\n- Eliminate dynamic new RegExp() for wildcard chars by using static\n  pre-built regex literals in WILDCARD_REGEX lookup table\n- Remove unnecessary async from applyProxiesCoreless (DeepSource JS-0116)\n\n* fix(gateway): suppress SonarCloud S5759 security hotspot\n\n* style(gateway): remove leftover comments in proxy middleware\n\n* feat: manually forward client connection headers in proxy middleware and disable automatic xfwd\n\n* Secret partially logging issue has been solved\n\n* refactor: remove verbose debug and error logging from Toki and base payment APIs","tree":{"sha":"10bc36a8350b0bf6e4250c00dbfffce40ae38161","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-payment/git/trees/10bc36a8350b0bf6e4250c00dbfffce40ae38161"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-payment/git/commits/764acb782868ae8ba7a1ba2fa84fdc4eb3d62cd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-payment/commit/764acb782868ae8ba7a1ba2fa84fdc4eb3d62cd5","node_id":"C_kwDOUq-d8toAKDc2NGFjYjc4Mjg2OGFlOGJhN2ExYmEyZmE4NGZkYzRlYjNkNjJjZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-payment/commit/284fdaad344d4e03ae3b93c6cc8ead570864a881","sha":"284fdaad344d4e03ae3b93c6cc8ead570864a881","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-payment/commits/284fdaad344d4e03ae3b93c6cc8ead570864a881"}],"sha":"764acb782868ae8ba7a1ba2fa84fdc4eb3d62cd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-payment/commits/764acb782868ae8ba7a1ba2fa84fdc4eb3d62cd5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40427263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soyombo-baterdene/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soyombo-baterdene/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soyombo-baterdene/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soyombo-baterdene/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soyombo-baterdene","id":40427263,"login":"soyombo-baterdene","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDI3MjYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soyombo-baterdene/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soyombo-baterdene/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soyombo-baterdene/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soyombo-baterdene/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soyombo-baterdene/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soyombo-baterdene","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-payment/commits/284fdaad344d4e03ae3b93c6cc8ead570864a881/comments","commit":{"author":{"