r_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-sales/commits/190f3b4268504a923e7078fd13a696a78db97ff0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T22:58:42Z","email":"65982680+Amartuvshins0404@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Amartuvshin Surenjav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T22:58:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(sales): bound and strictly validate agent-facing deal reads (#9102)\n\nAn agent calling deal.find with {} ran an unbounded find over 1.27M\ndeals and crash-looped the service (exit 139); wrapper-shaped input\n({ arg: ... } on find, { query: ... } on count) was silently treated\nas a document filter, matched nothing, and the agent reported \"no\ndata\" to users as fact.\n\n- deal.find input is now a strict object { query?, skip?, limit?,\n  sort?, fields? }: unknown keys are rejected by name, limit defaults\n  to 20 and is hard-capped at 100 on every path, and fields drives a\n  real projection so responses stay within the 64KB agent-tools budget\n- deal.count takes an explicit { filter? } object; {} counts all\n- agent-facing descriptions updated; no cross-plugin tRPC callers of\n  either procedure exist, so the tightened contracts break no consumers","tree":{"sha":"87e83ccc000d92f5e6f0724425a02013326f9c8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-sales/git/trees/87e83ccc000d92f5e6f0724425a02013326f9c8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-sales/git/commits/190f3b4268504a923e7078fd13a696a78db97ff0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-sales/commit/190f3b4268504a923e7078fd13a696a78db97ff0","node_id":"C_kwDOUq-fi9oAKDE5MGYzYjQyNjg1MDRhOTIzZTcwNzhmZDEzYTY5NmE3OGRiOTdmZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-sales/commit/f8d4089ac0731d3940cc52caeccba189c2788c17","sha":"f8d4089ac0731d3940cc52caeccba189c2788c17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-sales/commits/f8d4089ac0731d3940cc52caeccba189c2788c17"}],"sha":"190f3b4268504a923e7078fd13a696a78db97ff0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-sales/commits/190f3b4268504a923e7078fd13a696a78db97ff0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65982680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Amartuvshins0404","id":65982680,"login":"Amartuvshins0404","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1OTgyNjgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-sales/commits/f8d4089ac0731d3940cc52caeccba189c2788c17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T04:35:26Z","email":"65982680+Amartuvshins0404@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Amartuvshin Surenjav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T04:35:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(sales): expose safe tRPC procedures as agent-callable tools (#9058)\n\n* feat(sales): expose safe tRPC procedures as agent-callable tools\n\nAnnotate 12 read-only sales tRPC procedures with .meta(agentMeta(...))\nso they appear in the plugin''s /agent-tools/manifest, gated by sales\npermissions (showDeals, pipelinesWatch, posRead, posOrderRead):\n\n- deal.findOne, deal.find, deal.count, deal.getLink\n- stage.findOne, stage.find\n- pipeline.findOne\n- pos.findOne, pos.find, pos.ordersDeliveryInfo\n- orders.findOne, orders.find\n\nDeliberately not annotated: raw-mongo helpers (deal.aggregate,\norders.updateOne), system-user procedures (deal.create, deal.updateOne),\nprocedures trusting caller-supplied user objects (deal.createItem,\ndeal.editItem), POS device-sync endpoints, token-scoped lookups,\ndestructive bulk removes, and internal plumbing.\n\nAdds a local agentMeta helper mirroring core-api''s (plugin isolation\nforbids importing core-api source).\n\n* fix(sales): align agent tool descriptions with procedure behavior\n\nAddress review feedback on erxes/erxes#9058:\n\n- pos.find and deal.count documented a { query: ... } wrapper that the\n  implementations never unwrap; descriptions now show the direct\n  MongoDB filter shape (e.g. { isOnline: true }, { stageId: \"...\" })\n- pos.findOne and orders.findOne claimed \"Returns {} when nothing\n  matches\"; they return {} only for empty input and null on no match\n\nDescriptions only, no behavior changes.","tree":{"sha":"6c275af1832d29579c9b599c61f42e3def8138b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-sales/git/trees/6c275af1832d29579c9b599c61f42e3def8138b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-sales/git/commits/f8d4089ac0731d3940cc52caeccba189c2788c17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-sales/commit/f8d4089ac0731d3940cc52caeccba189c2788c17","node_id":"C_kwDOUq-fi9oAKGY4ZDQwODlhYzA3MzFkMzk0MGNjNTJjYWVjY2JhMTg5YzI3ODhjMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amaraa0404org/erxes-plugin-sales/commit/4c35333e6349867ff09e55ac98bbc606ac5dcfb3","sha":"4c35333e6349867ff09e55ac98bbc606ac5dcfb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amaraa0404org/erxe