d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomasz/cudz.io/commits/1dfec4d5f65982b6420d90369fad2dda082ded59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:59:56Z","email":"tomasz@luzid.co","name":"Tomasz Cudzilo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:59:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: merge with squash and require signed commits on main (#6)\n\n* chore: merge with squash and require signed commits on main\n\nRebase merges land unsigned, since GitHub can''t re-sign rebased commits,\nso they clash with the ruleset''s new required_signatures rule. Squash\nmerges are signed by GitHub. The Dependabot auto-merge switches to\n--squash to match.\n\ndependabot.yml drops the settings that were just defaults (schedule day,\ntime and timezone, and the PR limit) so it has the same shape as\nluzid.co''s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: run dependabot auto-merge on ubuntu-slim with a 7-day cooldown\n\nSame as luzid.co: the auto-merge job moves to the 1 vCPU ubuntu-slim\nrunner, and Dependabot waits 7 days for minor and patch releases, which\nis still above pnpm''s minimumReleaseAge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e77b20cb4c268a74e8a0bb78064702d370364345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomasz/cudz.io/git/trees/e77b20cb4c268a74e8a0bb78064702d370364345"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomasz/cudz.io/git/commits/1dfec4d5f65982b6420d90369fad2dda082ded59","verification":{"payload":"tree e77b20cb4c268a74e8a0bb78064702d370364345\nparent 9fe26541e54e9287d2979eec0f45c718bdace884\nauthor Tomasz Cudzilo <tomasz@luzid.co> 1790351996 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790351996 +0200\n\nchore: merge with squash and require signed commits on main (#6)\n\n* chore: merge with squash and require signed commits on main\n\nRebase merges land unsigned, since GitHub can''t re-sign rebased commits,\nso they clash with the ruleset''s new required_signatures rule. Squash\nmerges are signed by GitHub. The Dependabot auto-merge switches to\n--squash to match.\n\ndependabot.yml drops the settings that were just defaults (schedule day,\ntime and timezone, and the PR limit) so it has the same shape as\nluzid.co''s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: run dependabot auto-merge on ubuntu-slim with a 7-day cooldown\n\nSame as luzid.co: the auto-merge job moves to the 1 vCPU ubuntu-slim\nrunner, and Dependabot waits 7 days for minor and patch releases, which\nis still above pnpm''s minimumReleaseAge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtpp8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAB3AQAKBOSOVyTQMLYGx/ZtYze/4i\nlOzxiWI2r7E+8OVvz2iUlSS9SQ3ni+9UZXQzX+7sXE8o/kld70iQXPl2teR7/3FZ\n9tyBRV0GttQSYQOZ05YLAQ6FDNcNRlRIlQ+F0pnk30Qkr5Oa80U6AmpUKmCmD2vK\n4uoMHD/x4QeQXO6Y3iCBAQxaTny2LbSXWi+jivc4S12RGQxuSPtctYnhpeGNpO6E\nbc+S7gnkpTLMJCHCW+KsrGqktAw9hMzZZKfrLpXT3ruKAPD9TO62ILRwm5S3EXq7\n8RaQeT33p9iJJCvMAiDvi8cMRjZpCFtT1KjavHqfAGQ4Wo6gbkyY0RRCBN8XhIG1\nIdFqo85OkLbss533ibWJ2gHu9DF7r0QWkdqj1gF5YBwXyGKziDjc+1gTOSsCycuH\nKYrC/YrdN+PNuQAxOEMZ6tx+ZWV9Bhnn1UmGW9c+x0XAX6KzSRR8KqNFc053lrbK\nWwKnzwlsP1snReOfVpsWfkvUgbOtj674aBf2zj0p9OwdgeFNVli9b8GhKWp/nbzt\nV2x0Xk/rZyqhu4O62xhXTJuuiS3dXUwk+AUcgy39lArCHB9QrlacKQ8khoZl9JJJ\noZ1IxEZmzaeqhFdzttvBuxtBucZl0uU3GHOvwVIv51b2Tx/6vnN0EClrq7tegyrR\nLIPfj5cPs3ylETTzZ+Bm\n=tFcB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-0