ent_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:47:32Z","email":"tomasz@luzid.co","name":"Tomasz Cudzilo"},"message":"chore: switch dependency updates to Dependabot with CI-gated auto-merge\n\nDependabot now supports pnpm 12 (dependabot-core #16169), so drop\nRenovate in favour of the built-in bot.\n\n- dependabot.yml: npm + github-actions, weekly Monday 06:00 Warsaw,\n  3-day cooldown (14 for majors), minor/patch grouped, max 5 PRs.\n  TypeScript held at 6.0.x and Vitest at 4.1.x (see AGENTS.md).\n- ci.yml: format, lint, typecheck, test, gitleaks; dependency review\n  on PRs.\n- dependabot-automerge.yml: enables rebase auto-merge for non-major\n  Dependabot PRs; they merge only after the required checks pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a02b973baaf15f611544baf4662c5a9e6ab971f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomasz/cudz.io/git/trees/7a02b973baaf15f611544baf4662c5a9e6ab971f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomasz/cudz.io/git/commits/a847fc04fdc2000c51057d84f5724bde6aae4a3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomasz","id":103321,"login":"tomasz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzMyMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomasz/subscriptions","type":"User","