 fragment starts, so an event could arrive first and be lost:\nCI saw an empty mini cart and an empty store ID. The mini cart now\nreads the current quantity right after subscribing, and the checkout\nform marks itself once it listens. The thank-you page marks its canvas\nwhen the confetti fires, since the canvas is cleared after a second.\nTests wait for these marks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6446da4808b3299ee034da7daa829be039aa1c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/promesante/tractor-store-qwik/git/trees/c6446da4808b3299ee034da7daa829be039aa1c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/promesante/tractor-store-qwik/git/commits/55e733044d79068ce13429db945f363445f97df1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18708591?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/promesante/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/promesante/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/promesante/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/promesante/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/promesante","id":18708591,"login":"promesante","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzA4NTkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/promesante/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/promesante/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/promesante/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/promesante/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/promesante/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/promesante","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/promesante/tractor-store-qwik/commit/55e733044d79068ce13429db945f363445f97df1","node_id":"C_kwDOUr-pGtoAKDU1ZTczMzA0NGQ3OTA2OGNlMTM0MjlkYjk0NWYzNjM0NDVmOTdkZjE","pare