ll,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57397790?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dansarpong","id":57397790,"login":"dansarpong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3Mzk3Nzkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/commit/bf64078f5474ce977eceeedbf2740d069fdbe87f","node_id":"C_kwDOUsRHAtoAKGJmNjQwNzhmNTQ3NGNlOTc3ZWNlZWVkYmYyNzQwZDA2OWZkYmU4N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/commit/1f071529c0adb863385795fc307ee844595965d2","sha":"1f071529c0adb863385795fc307ee844595965d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/commits/1f071529c0adb863385795fc307ee844595965d2"}],"sha":"bf64078f5474ce977eceeedbf2740d069fdbe87f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/commits/bf64078f5474ce977eceeedbf2740d069fdbe87f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57397790?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dansarpong","id":57397790,"login":"dansarpong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3Mzk3Nzkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/commits/1f071529c0adb863385795fc307ee844595965d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:50:37Z","email":"daniel.sarpong@amalitech.com","name":"dansarpong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:50:37Z","email":"daniel.sarpong@amalitech.com","name":"dansarpong"},"message":"ci: migrate deployment from EC2 to ARMS EKS\n\nMove the frontend onto the ARMS platform: arms-libraries shared library, ECR in\nthe training account, and a Helm release on EKS behind NGINX Gateway Fabric.\nReplaces the single-EC2 deployment with host-level nginx and certbot TLS.\n\nRepository layout\n- Move the Angular app from achievement-tracker/ to the repository root. All six\n  ARMS frontends keep package.json at the root, and none of the arms Node\n  helpers (install/build/test/lint) accept a working directory, so a\n  subdirectory would have meant wrapping every stage in dir().\n- Update the paths that tracked it: Dockerfile, .dockerignore,\n  sonar-project.properties, .husky/pre-commit, .pre-commit-config.yaml, README\n  and docs. The Angular project is still named achievement-tracker, so\n  coverage/achievement-tracker/lcov.info is unchanged.\n- Merge the two .gitignore files into one at the root.\n\nPipeline\n- Thirteen stages, identical in name and order to hilfe-v2-frontend and the\n  other microfrontends: Setup Pipeline, Branch name validation, Packages\n  Validation, Check Linters, Run Tests, SonarQube Code Analysis, SonarQube Code\n  Quality, Install Dependencies, Build Application, Build Image, Scan Image,\n  Push to ECR, Deploy, with post { always { armsPostWork() } }.\n- Add the three standard scripts: scripts/branch-name-validator.sh (invoked by\n  armsBranchNameValidator with $CHANGE_BRANCH as $1, keeping this repo''s own\n  <type>/<description> regex), scripts/code-linter.sh and\n  scripts/packages-validator.js, which destructures this app''s whitelist field\n  achievementUtilizationTrackingFrontend.\n- Delete ci/ (11 scripts, aws-iam policies, gitleaks config), observability/\n  (promtail + Grafana bundle) and test.Dockerfile. Local pre-commit and husky\n  hooks are kept and unaffected — neither referenced ci/.\n\nBuild-time environment\n- armsBuildNodeApplication writes src/environments/environment.ts from Vault\n  before the build, one property per Vault key. Remove the production\n  fileReplacements entry from angular.json and delete environment.prod.ts,\n  whose getGraphqlUrl()/getSsoBaseUrl() derived URLs from the browser hostname\n  via host.replace(''-frontend'',''-backend'') — a substitution ARMS host naming\n  does not satisfy, with an SSO branch keyed off ''-staging'' that no ARMS host\n  contains.\n- Commit environment.ts as a typed fallback so ng test, ng lint and the\n  type-aware ESLint rules always resolve @environments/environment, and drop\n  the src/environments/ ignore rule that would have blocked it.\n- .yarnrc.yml now reads ${NPM_TOKEN:-} with npmAlwaysAuth, which is what the\n  shared library exports and what the other frontends use. Without\n  npmAlwaysAuth an unauthorised private package returns 404 rather than 401,\n  which reads as \"package does not exist\".\n- package.json: `test` becomes `ng test --watch=false --coverage`. Plain\n  `ng test` watches, which would hang the Run Tests stage, and Sonar''s\n  lcov.reportPaths needs the coverage run. test:watch is unchanged.\n\nImage and ingress\n- nginx.conf.template becomes a static nginx.conf. Drop the /api/ reverse proxy\n  and the BACKEND_HOST / BACKEND_PORT / BACKEND_SERVER_NAME envsubst: nothing\n  in src/ ever called /api/ — Apollo and the auth service both use absolute\n  URLs from environment — so the proxy was an artefact of the EC2 topology,\n  where the backend had no public hostname. No ARMS frontend uses envsubst.\n- The CSP is kept, with connect-src widened to wildcard origins, since the file\n  is baked into the image and per-environment hosts would otherwise need\n  runtime substitution.\n- .dockerignore no longer excludes dist/ (now the artefact the Dockerfile\n  copies) or nginx.conf (now COPYied in), and excludes the chart directory.\n\nChart\n- New achievement-utilization-tracking-frontend/ chart: Deployment, Service and\n  HTTPRoute, one values file per environment, static-nginx resource baseline\n  (cpu 10m, memory 32Mi request == limit, no CPU limit), targetPort 8080\n  because nginx runs as the non-root nginx user. No envFrom and no Reloader\n  annotation: there is no runtime Secret or ConfigMap to reload.\n- Hosts arms-auts-frontend-test and arms-auts-frontend-stage under\n  amalitech-dev.net. The existing auts-frontend.amalitech-dev.net record still\n  points at the old EC2 host and is deliberately left alone.\n\nDocs\n- New docs/arms-eks.md covers the pipeline, the chart and the Vault key\n  contract. docs/deploy-remote-detailed.md and docs/ssl-setup.md are marked\n  superseded rather than deleted, since that environment runs until cutover.","tree":{"sha":"c6e78c6ab9ec33a1885355006350a70bc0d61b05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/git/trees/c6e78c6ab9ec33a1885355006350a70bc0d61b05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/git/commits/1f071529c0adb863385795fc307ee844595965d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57397790?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dansarpong","id":57397790,"login":"dansarpong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3Mzk3Nzkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dansarpong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/commit/1f071529c0adb863385795fc307ee844595965d2","node_id":"C_kwDOUsRHAtoAKDFmMDcxNTI5YzBhZGI4NjMzODU3OTVmYzMwN2VlODQ0NTk1OTY1ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/commit/8afef7b79206eed9ebc2f5425be835fcbf86a6a7","sha":"8afef7b79206eed9ebc2f5425be835fcbf86a6a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/commits/8afef7b79206eed9ebc2f5425be835fcbf86a6a7"}],"sha":"1f071529c0adb863385795fc307ee844595965d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/commits/1f071529c0adb863385795fc307ee844595965d2"}