T/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/commits/5315de10e6874356bf1088b16b5eb16321a974b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:49:51Z","email":"Fiko8464@gmail.com","name":"Kofi Frimpong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:49:51Z","email":"Fiko8464@gmail.com","name":"Kofi Frimpong"},"message":"fix(ui-kit): add keyboard support to dropdown-filter options and accept custom-widget ARIA findings\n\nAdd a keydown.enter handler on each option so the SonarQube\nMouseEventWithoutKeyboardEquivalentCheck finding reflects real behavior\n(keyboard selection already worked via the trigger''s roving\naria-activedescendant focus). Suppress the remaining Web:S6819/S6842\nfindings via sonar-project.properties for this file only, since its\ncustom combobox/listbox/option widget matches the W3C ARIA APG''s own\nselect-only combobox reference pattern and a native <select> rewrite\nwas already tried and reverted for breaking the popup''s custom styling.","tree":{"sha":"8376c78144758d8031a5370b51f4c22682fd785b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/git/trees/8376c78144758d8031a5370b51f4c22682fd785b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/git/commits/5315de10e6874356bf1088b16b5eb16321a974b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128660273?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/followers","following_url