e":"Kofi Frimpong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:45:31Z","email":"Fiko8464@gmail.com","name":"Kofi Frimpong"},"message":"fix(ui-kit): rebuild dropdown-filter on a native select element\n\nReplace the ARIA combobox/listbox/option widget with a native <select>\nso keyboard navigation, typeahead, and semantics come from the browser\ninstead of hand-rolled logic. Options arrays that already include their\nown empty-value \"All\" entry are deduped against the synthetic placeholder\noption to avoid a value collision. openUpward is now a no-op (each\nbrowser places its own select popup) but kept on the input so existing\nconsumers don''t break. Updated the handful of consumer specs that\nqueried the old role=\"combobox\"/role=\"option\" markup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b26476beca6e86c90cb010758fdb045dfa612339","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/git/trees/b26476beca6e86c90cb010758fdb045dfa612339"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/git/commits/4fa94e87b5b8c19a73d2406aea6c699296527d4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128660273?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SKY-NYT","id":128660273,"login":"SKY-NYT","node_id":"U_kgDOB6szMQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url"