https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/commits/ea69dd4fbd26a2f8d1ff92d99f35659eeaef2891/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:21:42Z","email":"Fiko8464@gmail.com","name":"Kofi Frimpong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:21:42Z","email":"Fiko8464@gmail.com","name":"Kofi Frimpong"},"message":"test(ui-kit): update dropdown-filter consumer specs for combobox markup\n\nThe dropdown-filter trigger and options moved from <button>/role=\"menuitemradio\"\nto a div[role=\"combobox\"] with li[role=\"option\"] items; update the specs in\nadd-modal, pagination, and role-management that queried the old markup, and\nadd the new bothLong field to the audit-log enrich() spec assertion. Also\nrename ModalComponent''s private elementRef to _elementRef per the naming\nconvention lint rule since the file was already touched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b928f900809ce5e48d68d694040b4d22f7d4e66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/git/trees/7b928f900809ce5e48d68d694040b4d22f7d4e66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/git/commits/ea69dd4fbd26a2f8d1ff92d99f35659eeaef2891","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128660273?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKY-NYT/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SKY-NYT","id":128660273,"login":"SKY-NYT","node_id":"U_kgDOB6szMQ","organizations_url":"