ect dependencies:\n- dompurify: ^3.4.1 → ^3.4.15 (fixes 8 XSS/bypass CVEs)\n- vitest: ^4.0.8 → ^4.1.11 (fixes path traversal via @vitest/mocker)\n- @vitest/coverage-v8: ^4.1.5 → ^4.1.11\n\nPin transitive dependencies via yarn resolutions to patched versions:\n- @xmldom/xmldom 0.8.13 → 0.8.15 (8 CVEs: XSS, DoS, XML injection)\n- shell-quote 1.8.3 → 1.9.0 (CRITICAL: arbitrary code execution)\n- websocket-driver 0.7.4 → 0.7.5 (CRITICAL: protocol handler vuln)\n- browserslist 4.28.2 → 4.28.7 (ReDoS)\n- http-proxy-middleware 3.0.5 → 3.0.7 (request smuggling)\n- immutable 5.1.5 → 5.1.8 (prototype pollution)\n- js-yaml 3.14.2/4.1.1 → 3.15.2/4.3.2 (code execution, DoS)\n- nanoid 3.3.11 → 3.3.18 (entropy/collision CVEs)\n- pacote 21.3.1 → 21.5.1 (arbitrary file overwrite)\n- piscina 5.1.4 → 5.2.0 (thread pool DoS)\n- postcss 8.5.10-13 → 8.5.18 (info disclosure, path traversal)\n- sigstore 4.1.0 → 4.1.1 (verification bypass)\n- undici 7.24-25 → 7.29.0 (header injection, MITM, DoS)\n- vite 7.3.2/8.0.10 → 7.3.5/8.0.16 (fs.deny bypass)\n- ws 8.20.0 → 8.21.0 (memory exhaustion DoS)\n- @babel/plugin-transform-modules-systemjs 7.29.0 → 7.29.4\n\nRemaining unfixable: image-size@0.5.5 (2 HIGH, no patch exists;\ndev-only transitive via less@4.4.2, pinned to ~0.5.0)\n\nTrivy production scan: 0 HIGH/CRITICAL (was 8 HIGH)\nTrivy full scan: 2 HIGH, 0 CRITICAL (was 44 HIGH, 2 CRITICAL)\nyarn npm audit: clean (only deprecation notices remain)","tree":{"sha":"70b8b7a7f5f7c8610668780c8d1bf9af691d003f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/git/trees/70b8b7a7f5f7c8610668780c8d1bf9af691d003f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzibukaemmanuel/Achievement_and_utilization_tracking_system/git/commits/1d041885ae9cd822f7aa63bceaecea5e7a1462a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277848420?v=4","events_url":