trategy/commits/945d0f35bf1dde57d9125b563a520a761b8a9642"}],"sha":"8a39d5df78fa39d86315383d8af1168947eb6fd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ellenwang1/cognitionstrategy/commits/8a39d5df78fa39d86315383d8af1168947eb6fd7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46736870?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ellenwang1","id":46736870,"login":"ellenwang1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzM2ODcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ellenwang1/cognitionstrategy/commits/945d0f35bf1dde57d9125b563a520a761b8a9642/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T23:44:05Z","email":"46736870+ellenwang1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ellenwang1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T23:44:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #7 from ellenwang1/devin/1790603965-repo-cleanup\n\n* Move shared Python library from platform/core to packages/platform-core\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Flatten services/<tool>/app into services/<tool>\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Consolidate Python tests into root tests/\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Remove dead code from platform_core\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* De-duplicate shared helpers (utcnow/new_id, CORS, JWT issuer, database URL)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* ui-kit: drop unused shadcn files and dead exports\n\nDelete checkbox/select/skeleton primitives (plain-HTML versions live in\nprimitives.tsx) and trim exports nothing imports: AlertTitle/AlertDescription,\nTableFooter/TableCaption, Dialog trigger/close/description/portal/overlay,\nbutton link and lg variants, buttonVariants. Remove @radix-ui/react-checkbox\nand @radix-ui/react-select; move tailwindcss-animate to dependencies so the\ntailwind preset can require it from apps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* tool-sdk: remove dead code\n\nDelete validate.ts (backend Pydantic model owns validation), unused\nToolApiClient.config/pendingApprovals, redundant Entity intersection,\nduplicate styles.css imports in remote main.tsx files, and collapse the\nthree identical remotes.d.ts declarations into one ''*/Tool'' module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* deps: dedupe build dependencies across apps\n\nApps use @originjs/vite-plugin-federation, @rollup/plugin-yaml and\n@vitejs/plugin-react only via @platform/tool-sdk/vite, so drop them from\nthe four app manifests along with per-app tailwindcss-animate. Remove\njson-schema-to-typescript and the lint/gen:types aliases from the root.\n\nAlias the federation plugin to tool-sdk''s resolved copy in remote.mjs:\nthe plugin re-resolves itself by bare name during build, which fails\nunder pnpm''s strict layout once it is no longer an app dependency.\n\nDockerfile.web copies only packages/tool-sdk and packages/ui-kit so the\nweb image won''t pick up the incoming Python package under packages/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Validate config field cross-references in ToolConfig\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* make schema runs export + gen:types; parametrize venv path\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* platform(web): keep vite-plugin-federation as an app devDependency instead of aliasing it\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs: shorten README/CONTRIBUTING/METRICS, add AGENTS.md, drop db/README.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ellen.huiwang <ellen.huiwang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0f12b0a94b51e4c9666c62495624e62ac193e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ellenwang1/cognitionstrategy/git/trees/f0f12b0a94b51e4c9666c62495624e62ac193e07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ellenwang1/cognitionstrategy/git/commits/945d0f35bf1dde57d9125b563a520a761b8a9642","verification":{"payload":"tree f0f12b0a94b51e4c9666c62495624e62ac193e07\nparent 34ad6438074aef0883637024b32f6b2720040588\nparent ffad2ae9a9149cc6545a5ebc122f870caa8a6eb6\nauthor ellenwang1 <46736870+ellenwang1@users.noreply.github.com> 1790639045 +1000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790639045 +1000\n\nMerge pull request #7 from ellenwang1/devin/1790603965-repo-cleanup\n\n* Move shared Python library from platform/core to packages/platform-core\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Flatten services/<tool>/app into services/<tool>\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Consolidate Python