k and packages/ui-kit so the\nweb image won''t pick up the incoming Python package under packages/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Validate config field cross-references in ToolConfig\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* make schema runs export + gen:types; parametrize venv path\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* platform(web): keep vite-plugin-federation as an app devDependency instead of aliasing it\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs: shorten README/CONTRIBUTING/METRICS, add AGENTS.md, drop db/README.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ellen.huiwang <ellen.huiwang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquvvFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACAkQAFN4vtV6s3GD6I+5eSuqInmQ\nHfyT1NL9EvOcuiV5JS0+48cxMC83FI/XxxFN4ctqF6eRUme5eZ7oWJMrqYLFrH9E\n9RzDV1U0gimH9AvON+k717F1AEwIdHBQX+kSt3jy+hTEUw03R+oW2KWj1EyhV2Sh\n1L25lZ/LjVOOyC6FDdJGqCjWSkwwTAa03N0hrSxPyQjvidIsbZHskCac3I0AO7AP\nFMir3o2nadwyeTDu93yzcH/OKyJ6rb0hH2Uck4YxJVrCsCdQkffulueQHK3gc1eX\nyOfmllPlzjORrbCoVVjE9Siz6wZXurj4TYfzWo05G+yM8+H0u2vEWt/B+QLKUvab\nVFN+eylS2fCqUs2OWk17hdVuX3zn2R8qVUw0rYLLK5r8rdPmoXXC+DJoY99BUC0g\nFGTru76W202u29u9FqW2QS875CnfaocVhB+t/3gq7JUTxQn1hYsxdkwKMHwePFep\nrpqwz1U6L6jlY95m+q0bV2KzZRz5J/Ujs2h5a4Pz8suraWaEepQAX0WtlhRCOi4t\nVb4ehYHJVZwHdf+XI2WUIU79+pY5wicpr6NI3qw+1LrBjB8oj7V0+ZHTUGxKiaDo\nsJ9jvMkIxRK7hdo3ZJUYmRYISxCTsLOBdkcQ8EOs5bdzysazhZ1ORxOxmsc2XIpG\nDHLfdZCPDQipaPJxt6Z0\n=R1aY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T23:44:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4",