1","id":46736870,"login":"ellenwang1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzM2ODcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenwang1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ellenwang1/cognitionstrategy/commits/06b541741ae325fbfcdfa6485da99aad5bf3885e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:06:31Z","email":"ellen.huiwang@gmail.com","name":"ellen.huiwang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:06:31Z","email":"ellen.huiwang@gmail.com","name":"ellen.huiwang"},"message":"deps: dedupe build dependencies across apps\n\nApps use @originjs/vite-plugin-federation, @rollup/plugin-yaml and\n@vitejs/plugin-react only via @platform/tool-sdk/vite, so drop them from\nthe four app manifests along with per-app tailwindcss-animate. Remove\njson-schema-to-typescript and the lint/gen:types aliases from the root.\n\nAlias the federation plugin to tool-sdk''s resolved copy in remote.mjs:\nthe plugin re-resolves itself by bare name during build, which fails\nunder pnpm''s strict layout once it is no longer an app dependency.\n\nDockerfile.web copies only packages/tool-sdk and packages/ui-kit so the\nweb image won''t pick up the incoming Python package under packages/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"46791e6038dd0434cf661eb760dbba1cf9efed22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ellenwang1/cognitionstrategy/git/trees/46791e6038dd0434cf661eb760dbba1cf9efed22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ellenwang1/cognitionstrategy/git/commits/06b541741ae325fbfcdfa6485da99aad5bf3885e","verificat