iour. Tap-to-cycle stays as the\naccessibility path, with the trailing click suppressed after a real drag.\n\nRegenerated README screenshots.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(host): drop the detent dots under the insights grab bar (#62)\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d511fcbc454ba0ba15374775530237013c5fb59d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/d511fcbc454ba0ba15374775530237013c5fb59d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/c2e342050b1d661b66a1b8bcc614f00ce5165b44","verification":{"payload":"tree d511fcbc454ba0ba15374775530237013c5fb59d\nparent 3cca69702b2e11afd56c9160e054e558cd481bfa\nauthor John Nooney <71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com> 1790693216 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790693216 +0100\n\nfeat(host): drag-to-snap insights sheet, grab bar replaces chevron (#63)\n\n* feat(host): drag-to-snap insights sheet, grab bar replaces chevron (#62)\n\nThe handle''s chevron implied a binary toggle; a plain grab pill reads as\ndraggable. The sheet now tracks the finger via an inline height with the\ntransition disabled, then snaps to the nearest of the existing\npeek/half/full detents on release — a fast flick advances one detent past\nthe nearest, matching iOS sheet behaviour. Tap-to-cycle stays as the\naccessibility path, with the trailing click suppressed after a real drag.\n\nRegenerated README screenshots.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(host): drop the detent dots under the insights grab bar (#62)\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nC