eb-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commit/c2e342050b1d661b66a1b8bcc614f00ce5165b44","node_id":"C_kwDOUsm60NoAKGMyZTM0MjA1MGIxZDY2MWI2NmExYjhiY2M2MTRmMDBjZTUxNjViNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commit/3cca69702b2e11afd56c9160e054e558cd481bfa","sha":"3cca69702b2e11afd56c9160e054e558cd481bfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/3cca69702b2e11afd56c9160e054e558cd481bfa"}],"sha":"c2e342050b1d661b66a1b8bcc614f00ce5165b44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/c2e342050b1d661b66a1b8bcc614f00ce5165b44"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71711553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney","id":71711553,"login":"JohnNooney","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/3cca69702b2e11afd56c9160e054e558cd481bfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:46:56Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:46:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(readme): visitor layer — badges, live link, screenshots, dev:demo (#52) (#61)\n\n* docs(readme): visitor layer — badges, live link, screenshots, dev:demo (#52)\n\nThe README front-loads contributor machinery; restructure it for portfolio\nreaders first: pitch → CI/license badges → live link → three committed\nscreenshots → a self-serve \"Try it yourself\" run. Internals (e2e wiring,\nApp Check debug tokens, Node/Angular and macOS port notes) move to\ndocs/development.md.\n\n- e2e/tests/screenshots.spec.ts captures reader/library/mobile shots via\n  the seeded harness; `pnpm screenshots` regenerates docs/screenshots/*.png\n  deterministically under the fake AI provider\n- `pnpm dev:demo` wraps `VITE_FAKE_AI_PROVIDER=true pnpm dev` — seeded\n  experience on a fresh clone, no env vars or keys\n- fix the stale Node-20 pin note while moving it (workspace pins 24)\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test(e2e): realistic multi-page fixture Documents (#52)\n\nThe seed PDFs were one-line stubs — flat in the README hero shot and\nincoherent: the Mietvertrag Extraction quotes clauses from pages 2-4 that\ndid not exist. scripts/make-fixtures.mjs now emits the three fixtures as\nreal documents — a 4-page Mietvertrag (each quoted clause on its cited\npage), a 2-page Versicherungsschein, a Finanzamt letter — deterministic,\ndependency-free raw PDF (WinAnsi Helvetica).\n\n- refresh emulator-data via pnpm seed so dev/dev:demo serves them\n- page-count assertions follow the 4-page Mietvertrag\n- screenshots spec: wait out the background \"is ready\" toast''s lifecycle\n  instead of asserting it — its timing varies with emulator load\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"acd5688da5dc8de4b4127814004ec767401dfea0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/acd5688da5dc8de4b4127814004ec767401dfea0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/3cca69702b2e11afd56c9160e054e558cd481bfa","verification":{"payload":"tree acd5688da5dc8de4b4127814004ec767401dfea0\nparent 295a3d6da0477bd781dfdc91ba6e4edd499e975d\nauthor John Nooney <71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com> 1790689616 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790689616 +0100\n\ndocs(readme): visitor layer — badges, live link, screenshots, dev:demo (#52) (#61)\n\n* docs(readme): visitor layer — badges, live link, screenshots, dev:demo (#52)\n\nThe README front-loads contributor machinery; restructure it for portfolio\nreaders first: pitch → CI/license badges → live link → three committed\nscreenshots → a self-serve \"Try it yourself\" run. Internals (e2e wiring,\nApp Check debug tokens, Node/Angular and macOS port notes) move to\ndocs/development.md.\n\n- e2e/tests/screenshots.spec.ts captures reader/library/mobile shots via\n  the seeded harness; `pnpm screenshots` regenerates docs/screenshots/*.png\n  deterministically under the fake AI provider\n- `pnpm dev:demo` wraps `VITE_FAKE_AI_PROVIDER=true pnpm dev` — seeded\n  experience on a fresh clone, no env vars or keys\n- fix the stale Node-20 pin note while moving it (workspace pins 24)\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test(e2e): realistic multi-page fixture Documents (#52)\n\nThe seed PDFs were one-line stubs — flat in the README hero shot and\nincoherent: the Mietvertrag Extraction quotes clauses from pages 2-4 that\ndid not exist. scripts/make-fixtures.mjs now emits the three fixtures as\nreal documents — a 4-page Mietvertrag (each quoted clause on its cited\npage), a 2-page Versicherungsschein, a Finanzamt letter — deterministic,\ndependency-free raw PDF (WinAnsi Helvetica).\n\n- refresh emulator-data via pnpm seed so dev/dev:demo serves them\n- page-count assertions follow the 4-page Mietvertrag\n- screenshots spec: wait out the background \"is ready\" toast''s lifecycle\n  instead of asserting it — its timing varies with emulator load\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu8FQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGesQAF5f7j5uXsxlo7iWRA+UNWul\nAvb1pQ/PwBR2SuWBhPFFgA78bSdzZLkBgr22TN3qBX75D0e7aK9bl4aT4tFqlc/Z\n201+g8bqdzStC6uOkLXn4iBL1Tupp1QHXTYBc3dWQbrm22UNUuWfU0J3cNSbNhky\nOiAWORokE+et6GneEkm67IQB/hcRP5gZi3lWXNkOaAyS+i6RYCHFTUgWEL6bnIlU\nGQQeT0auKF3drMZptb6PIODve0cMxIdxjEdpGB/RmndJS1XKGjoRdfjJdX/6XSJy\nze3qp8Eauy+6csJSaIcpj+qCh8z3pdOqlQ+RMjDxKCAwy8wvmCLSPi9iTpmQUInR\nVzms2Fi052egJObQGPNUWcOoC92zYfz05P2sHJ7QnkMyU37gZdlvlGMsV+H/Vpy3\nZhS0YgHTNQ+KqA3IYn9t1lIHgtZoy7fVZyTqf1M7XW4elUaGCDBQYTd7e/RbuuW0\nHHi1LUujpmUQieTzEONL1aV8xkqkpnuWT5gUadtOjED2IJVwmBpaegcv9Od5jqyo\nvyCsCDMGYfqfUCFto3lr0QfyMSr31QcNIHD8lu9WM7iPMGC2iemIpKzdXc/uUiSc\nCmuxVOlBe/SGle/gy2HhrRYqdIWw/ofjpDSa41b63GICQrlkx/IExcZGfk9DlgrZ\n2XswFE7A9HQdPfsSV7yO\n=rCa0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T13:46:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.