/api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney","id":71711553,"login":"JohnNooney","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/0c43c48be6c07537a475efd40a43105d99538e2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:23:12Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:23:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(e2e): in-flight upload row stays inside the mobile viewport (#48) (#58)\n\nThe #47 row fix already made the progress bar flex instead of forcing\n100% width; this lands the missing verification. The spec holds a real\nresumable upload mid-flight (lets the first 256 KB chunk POST land, gates\nthe rest), then asserts the progressbar reports an in-between percent,\nits fill tracks it, and thumbnail/title/progress/⋮ all sit inside the\nphone viewport with no horizontal overflow. The bounding-box check moves\ninto support.ts so both mobile row specs share it.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"80e1f708efc7d5554f39602f73b754f0b7d4ca17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/80e1f708efc7d5554f39602f73b754f0b7d4ca17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/0c43c48be6c07537a475efd40a43105d99538e2c","verification":{"payload":"tree 80e1f708efc7d5554f39602f73b754f0b7d4ca17\nparent 1011fb0a61ba3bb4dfdc0cb48fb1b83e7910b532\nauthor John Nooney <71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com> 1790680992 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790680992 +0100\n\ntest(e2e): in-flight upload row stays inside the mobile viewport (#48) (#58)\n\nThe #47 row fix already made the progress bar flex instead of forcing\n100% width; this lands the missing verification. The spec holds a real\nresumable upload mid-flight (lets the first 256 KB chunk POST land, gates\nthe rest), then asserts the progressbar reports an in-between percent,\nits fill tracks it, and thumbnail/title/progress/⋮ all sit inside the\nphone viewport with no horizontal overflow. The bounding-box check moves\ninto support.ts so both mobile row specs share it.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu5+gCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcIUQAFmcXFfnPaKfTjAMftg0xD2+\n9oDNO2/qhKqlDauZYH+CYOVgIYJon7rdv40j14WunUwOLwZc+beSjsbLCCYv8R7l\n0DwxlAYbmnXdxYysLdM0JDYDmNy77SFOV4rznxxwnydymUlTZlc3yV2M4DA2sNdE\nS8Y9iB8pDIy3lsJdvmylHTXiofxUrS3FJFlAa9m/ot8UK4VKleK9vnP17Lb8jpb6\ngPVvuprCxltnNH5czmVG1FOsgghC0hmI9a4XIoS1hx9TReVHa6Gd7u2rWtBDTsgE\nqThhhrzJv/Sti3ShRyt5CX421axGbDt6Ijf3j7UnlWr9w67QsH9DFnU7fs/Aeevl\nP+rPTRz28f5x6YgTM/YrFPbSug0z3l1RsGHmJ8yjdwEtjJLyhlu7qqpMf6ovcfaX\nwEVy45AsdhVK3AOw2sgB/COBMNQJl46ihC/FA3r0l5x8HpZ1GKQI5JQF6fOXIgSf\nHI9MkosKGT3EVSlOeKIYtk6r9L/PHoUjb5pqs7XTtDipfhaAx6D6bRw58z7m/s5V\nOa43Y3MgV0NCzjsBjCLlH/wnTtbTTSOOW69vHqBLkz1mE5/QatXFAvIIY8GJTpEX\nNTyKkG7x3tBiOK2h689lERZMQSkB0G8n+vTXnYR/S+Or8wRw9htNhgHD5kj8T3TC\nYjLArTJdX6klB4ieSoZo\n=IR9a\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T11:23:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserc