g5NWU5ZWJhNmE0NmJjMjU2NjgyNTIyNTUyYjZiODY0ZTRjY2JmNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commit/3d2551606d3c74b4430ddb0c081e2f3792d944d1","sha":"3d2551606d3c74b4430ddb0c081e2f3792d944d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/3d2551606d3c74b4430ddb0c081e2f3792d944d1"}],"sha":"895e9eba6a46bc256682522552b6b864e4ccbf6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/895e9eba6a46bc256682522552b6b864e4ccbf6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71711553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney","id":71711553,"login":"JohnNooney","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/3d2551606d3c74b4430ddb0c081e2f3792d944d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T09:41:12Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T09:41:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(host): insights sheet detents — rests at peek, cycles peek→half→full (#50) (#54)\n\n* feat(host): insights sheet detents — rests at peek, cycles peek→half→full (#50)\n\nThe mobile sheet opened at half height and only toggled to full, so the\nGuest panel buried most of the PDF. It now has three snap detents and\nrests at peek — the grab-handle strip plus a minimal \"Insights\" header —\nwhen a Document opens (the detent is a linkedSignal on OpenDocument).\nThe handle cycles peek → half → full → peek; its affordance reads the\nstate (a detent dot per snap point, chevron pointing where the tap moves)\nand aria-expanded tracks collapsed-vs-expanded. The PDF stage gets bottom\nclearance so the last page never rests under the peek chrome. Desktop\nright-lane rendering is untouched.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor(host): shared peek-height token, detent dots via @for (#50)\n\nReview follow-ups: the peek chrome height (grab strip + minimal header)\nis now one theme token — --kt-sheet-peek-height — shared by the sheet''s\npeek detent and the PDF stage''s clearance, the dots render via @for, and\nthe visible \"Insights\" header is no longer hidden from assistive tech.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f35580741584c5e3fba1a25ec2d96cab0d4efaf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/f35580741584c5e3fba1a25ec2d96cab0d4efaf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/3d2551606d3c74b4430ddb0c081e2f3792d944d1","verification":{"payload":"tree f35580741584c5e3fba1a25ec2d96cab0d4efaf9\nparent 614aedea87209c66f05bc3e95d583b309b74d64d\nauthor John Nooney <71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com> 1790674872 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790674872 +0100\n\nfeat(host): insights sheet detents — rests at peek, cycles peek→half→full (#50) (#54)\n\n* feat(host): insights sheet detents — rests at peek, cycles peek→half→full (#50)\n\nThe mobile sheet opened at half height and only toggled to full, so the\nGuest panel buried most of the PDF. It now has three snap detents and\nrests at peek — the grab-handle strip plus a minimal \"Insights\" header —\nwhen a Document opens (the detent is a linkedSignal on OpenDocument).\nThe handle cycles peek → half → full → peek; its affordance reads the\nstate (a detent dot per snap point, chevron pointing where the tap moves)\nand aria-expanded tracks collapsed-vs-expanded. The PDF stage gets bottom\nclearance so the last page never rests under the peek chrome. Desktop\nright-lane rendering is untouched.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor(host): shared peek-height token, detent dots via @for (#50)\n\nReview follow-ups: the peek chrome height (grab strip + minimal header)\nis now one theme token — --kt-sheet-peek-height — shared by the sheet''s\npeek detent and the PDF stage''s clearance, the dots render via @for, and\nthe visible \"Insights\" header is no longer hidden from assistive tech.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu4e4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZ2IQAEMMg5Jy7IxFM40VxQqWRsev\nGkIIeVJTourMYBNX6kTSOAreI2sgWbAWkrzBvGQbzptf1RxWVYeL5kyZuIgNUsX0\nTOeAEYHfwf9m3+BE75fKfHtoU+qREmli4DC8vycpNvnmevSi6QDNYfZFHEduXXoI\nLYySTAd1gpJf5B47YjyIlBSsaxC7nhTbJsfnUcTuogC6+1pbnmskbpwZlI7qlxH4\nimP+u5XHGBPqt6RPQGUTbsnejRSrY8z7aaIUV4bNO94DN24eFbOxMRiWH7jJUGNO\nZwQTEQmS1dEUVtoXifyFB2Ka/SBQ/c796UsfKifyIocbBkChbqc0sidwyWoqC/3S\nUoveQI8sjyXa9Z1I/7IXrr9d+YwSw4oP6gw1WtS7pkRBOIzoqiuQuNVPPfvDfURf\nIrR8qQpgcysFpfsWPVmljBFxG19WiTsP25dIBcF