eceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/b33cf0ee9feccd833d29bcf7373462e9a85ab949/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:46:42Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:46:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Playwright e2e suite across the iframe under emulators:exec (#34) (#51)\n\n* test(e2e): Playwright suite across the iframe under emulators:exec (#34)\n\n- e2e workspace package: chromium-only Playwright, no webServer; baseURL\n  from firebase.json. Journeys: sign-in gate/sign-out, upload → background\n  Extraction → toast → open beside pdf.js, paging, Folder create/nest/move,\n  recursive delete, failed-upload retry via drop, re-analyze. Guest only\n  via frameLocator.\n- `pnpm e2e`: build:e2e (Guest fake-AI + emulator flags, Host dist\n  config.json → Guest :5055) then emulators:exec seed + test:e2e. CI e2e\n  job runs it.\n- Hosting emulator moved to :5050/:5055 — macOS AirPlay holds :5000.\n- Fix: a fast Extraction for the open Document left the panel stuck on\n  \"Re-analyzing…\" — a stale `running` Session followed the adapter''s\n  result resend. The flow now mirrors that resend and clears the job on\n  success.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test(e2e): review fixes — toast helper, seed uid source\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f294f7ed640055bfeb44786252b5f1f228732eb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/f294f7ed640055bfeb44786252b5f1f228732eb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/b33cf0ee9feccd833d29bcf7373462e9a85ab949","verification":{"payload":"tree f294f7ed640055bfeb44786252b5f1f228732eb7\nparent 57d59309259181f29b8e6ff0261243f2e0235184\nauthor John Nooney <71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com> 1790668002 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790668002 +0100\n\nPlaywright e2e suite across the iframe under emulators:exec (#34) (#51)\n\n* test(e2e): Playwright suite across the iframe under emulators:exec (#34)\n\n- e2e workspace package: chromium-only Playwright, no webServer; baseURL\n  from firebase.json. Journeys: sign-in gate/sign-out, upload → background\n  Extraction → toast → open beside pdf.js, paging, Folder create/nest/move,\n  recursive delete, failed-upload retry via drop, re-analyze. Guest only\n  via frameLocator.\n- `pnpm e2e`: build:e2e (Guest fake-AI + emulator flags, Host dist\n  config.json → Guest :5055) then emulators:exec seed + test:e2e. CI e2e\n  job runs it.\n- Hosting emulator moved to :5050/:5055 — macOS AirPlay holds :5000.\n- Fix: a fast Extraction for the open Document left the panel stuck on\n  \"Re-analyzing…\" — a stale `running` Session followed the adapter''s\n  result resend. The flow now mirrors that resend and clears the job on\n  success.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test(e2e): review fixes — toast helper, seed uid source\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integr