:"C_kwDOUsm60NoAKGIzM2NmMGVlOWZlY2NkODMzZDI5YmNmNzM3MzQ2MmU5YTg1YWI5NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commit/57d59309259181f29b8e6ff0261243f2e0235184","sha":"57d59309259181f29b8e6ff0261243f2e0235184","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/57d59309259181f29b8e6ff0261243f2e0235184"}],"sha":"b33cf0ee9feccd833d29bcf7373462e9a85ab949","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/b33cf0ee9feccd833d29bcf7373462e9a85ab949"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71711553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney","id":71711553,"login":"JohnNooney","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/57d59309259181f29b8e6ff0261243f2e0235184/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:13:16Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:13:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(host): Folder tree, tiles, drag-to-file and recursive delete (#46)\n\n* feat(host): Folder tree, tiles, drag-to-file and recursive delete (#33)\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(host): harden Folder delete and moves per review (#33)\n\nExclude deleting Folders from counts, refuse deleting targets, mark\ndeleting before navigating, settle in-flight uploads before teardown,\nleave unbrowsable Folders, reconcile each subtree once.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs(host): fix garbled deleteFolder comment\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(host): close upload/delete race in UploadPipeline (#33)\n\nA delete landing while an upload''s metadata was still being created let\nthe bytes start afterwards, orphaning them. The pipeline now blocks such\nuploads and cancels+settles live ones before teardown.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6548c6ffc97f707fdcbb9fa7fc2713d60271097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/e6548c6ffc97f707fdcbb9fa7fc2713d60271097"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/57d59309259181f29b8e6ff0261243f2e0235184","verification":{"payload":"tree e6548c6ffc97f707fdcbb9fa7fc2713d60271097\nparent ef5c8cd6e723929796cd50a68d251f8ec2ddb58e\nauthor John Nooney <71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com> 1790665996 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790665996 +0100\n\nfeat(host): Folder tree, tiles, drag-to-file and recursive delete (#46)\n\n* feat(host): Folder tree, tiles, drag-to-file and recursive delete (#33)\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(host): harden Folder delete and moves per review (#33)\n\nExclude deleting Folders from counts, refuse deleting targets, mark\ndeleting before navigating, settle in-flight uploads before teardown,\nleave unbrowsable Folders, reconcile each subtree once.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs(host): fix garbled deleteFolder comment\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(host): close upload/delete race in UploadPipeline (#33)\n\nA delete landing while an upload''s metadata was still being created let\nthe bytes start afterwards, orphaning them. The pipeline now blocks such\nuploads and cancels+settles live ones before teardown.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu2UMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAn88QAKUdBDkqs3dEZQNVU/KMXG1/\noA2H6+VRL8d1CXHluxMjjsmHMdcv0k7SDMCTeqgleMs19r78roKMNTy2XqZS4m41\nL5W1KacjcYj7JFDZBQmbsZ6M7n3zJ35AYRMl/f0WYnln+hkz+ivvQLRqjip+teCs\nQRDBlIkzS7jb2N0zLNZ10rT3gTqUq6QEQRGkrlxzPDKHa836OXveT0LIvBg9nzc2\nGZXddsBW/4+BlT+wqj1xP7alINFNgXHhwse1uUywOWHhHNK5sGtLg02w551dLJkB\nMn8imXerC1TB6sSOSaStoamOgrKpo6zhlxE6+NWp2hYMYz0MDDDujtqLJntv9oKn\n28L0u+rSF1/DT7oDsDp07E3bKNyUWRPEmPobzVK7sUkka7JtP3X+wTVYZgbZOdeF\nE0jDIJyO+evjWbY7svrQwTBJiAE0yoQo8ujnVGw+tXhgmm3xtLThlm42RxrP2tUG\nWDMoeu0clEBhRCq445+cF6TrSAJyVSXS2rjK4n9D8eDEC7ubeJrvwyUnLdxcMwjV\nop8uO066UpMenSngtFPmgkI3BKs0SYm08/LPhyzFcGeO2kt7+A5HJ+EChEZyxaR7\nGpE/6UtZgIYGVAm6JoGDNsej5Xm0t5uWjUQ/XizcRlqCAsEXgq/L2+YEtcZqiRxj\nfYJjd+qRONjOf44w8hCR\n=ujqw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"