ub.com/JohnNooney","id":71711553,"login":"JohnNooney","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/ef5c8cd6e723929796cd50a68d251f8ec2ddb58e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T06:40:05Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T06:40:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: extraction lifecycle UX — explorer chips, toast actions, re-analyze (#32) (#45)\n\nThe user-facing lifecycle on top of #31''s job orchestration: ready tiles\nwear a chip per job state (Queued / spinner + \"Analyzing…\" / warning\n\"Couldn''t analyze\" with ⋮ Retry analysis, suppressed while a stored\nExtraction stands), background toasts carry actions (View opens the\nDocument, Try again re-enqueues), and the Guest''s failed-re-analysis\nbanner is dismissible. Job states and stored-Extraction ids live on the\nLibraryStore — the library''s state seam — written by ExtractionFlow, so\nchips survive no reload and a transient repo read no longer costs a\nDocument its auto-enqueue.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a41d12a7cb51c8479a938426fc1ec544fe0e3841","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/a41d12a7cb51c8479a938426fc1ec544fe0e3841"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/ef5c8cd