ons_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/a385dfe9abb0c43903326fbde71d3741ebc17f82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:35:04Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:35:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(host): document library UI — tiles, lifecycle, upload flow (#28) (#41)\n\nFiles-style tile grid over a live Firestore watch, with the full Document\nlifecycle surfaced per state: uploading (progress + cancel), ready (open,\nrename, move, download, delete), failed (in-session retry via held File,\ndrop-to-retry under the same documentId, or remove), deleting (spinner +\nretry delete). Upload dialog and grid-level drops reject non-PDF/>10 MB\nwith the spec''d notification; delete cancels queued/running Extraction\nJobs via the new HostAdapter.cancelJobs and navigates back when the open\nDocument is removed. Frosted toast outlet; Guest iframe stays mounted\nhidden until a Document is open.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d4af76c9cae8221260f72da417cff4bd57a1cde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/4d4af76c9cae8221260f72da417cff4bd57a1cde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/a385dfe9abb0c43903326fbde71d3741ebc17f82","verification":{"payload":"tree 4d4af76c9cae8221260f7