jcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/3a002279bb868e8633c7c75a1daba59bcd7bd589/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T06:39:48Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T06:39:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(host): document repositories, upload pipeline (#40)\n\nHost-only data layer per #9/#16/#18: DocumentRepository and\nExtractionRepository receive initialized SDK instances via constructors —\nsame code in prod and emulators. UploadPipeline drives the metadata-first\nmachine: uploading → ready/failed, cancel scrubs metadata + partial bytes,\ndelete tears down bytes → Extraction → metadata (retryable), startup\nreconciliation for orphaned uploading/deleting. Input boundary rejects\nanything but application/pdf ≤10 MB loudly. New test:integration runs the\nstate machine and extractions/current under firebase emulators:exec, plus\na @firebase/rules-unit-testing suite over the committed rules (non-owner,\n>10 MB, non-PDF denied). Startup reconcile wiring lands with the library\nUI (#28).\n\nCloses #27\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"242dc1b574f795a448c4a54e9f709ed7c1066d69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/242dc1b574f795a448c4a54e9f709ed7c1066d69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/3a002279bb868e8633c7c75a1daba59bcd7bd589","verification":{"payload":"tree 242dc1b574f795a448c4a54e9f709ed7c1066d69\nparent 02f7366b8006f91cdc1d59070e520c20f8e7590a\nauthor John Nooney <71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com> 1790577588 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790577588 +0100\n\nfeat(host): document repositories, upload pipeline (#40)\n\nHost-only data layer per #9/#16/#18: DocumentRepository and\nExtractionRepository receive initialized SDK instances via constructors —\nsame code in prod and emulators. UploadPipeline drives the metadata-first\nmachine: uploading → ready/failed, cancel scrubs metadata + partial bytes,\ndelete tears down bytes → Extraction → metadata (retryable), startup\nreconciliation for orphaned uploading/deleting. Input boundary rejects\nanything but application/pdf ≤10 MB loudly. New test:integration runs the\nstate machine and extractions/current under firebase emulators:exec, plus\na @firebase/rules-unit-testing suite over the committed rules (non-owner,\n>10 MB, non-PDF denied). Startup reconcile wiring lands with the library\nUI (#28).\n\nCloses #27\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqugu0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAICEQABYEiyEzso68wsM3A2QPAGUw\nfsJGkdqUaglx7TcZyTtpLiPMiJmXCRS9NYRxk3wP6fK/mTVXUpw649Jd+fSSPujq\nH0yof6vR85gthwaEGnfeRiORP3bO4c1h4Ur3EIbw6xPI0OY/7mMJgIDWS11+JRcY\nuENJL7a+2JU1Z0EmR26BXQdquUqonVnd38YMvnwp0e1PN6K76PSdyp4JU/77KQ41\n0m0DJ3dZPxI2EbW3A9GKqSs68G/wglsDvvXNFqfWMQva1wYiTJ42WvtKE77BC12O\nnxzpsYIGQQpX1l6ICe+1rOW/i1sPGr6msV+9+A2ZKphFHZrwzZMEZmaqYCuP+jXs\nZk3mQrzZBq3SmbpBbE5kKzhV9ZBpOq52TiJXQMO24Z1OMc87lwTXRoEQX4O/Nvqs\nfMxlV16/aL/kXPhbUIAcKnYsnllf9Vj27Eh+zxTf8YRB5BYJIpsBPQgdUB2bCVkH\nfSdb50wolmJE9E4tCKUJA+ESzlwD0Z+vUs8rTAnqFULmD0HyJUxITMthN/hDRJDq\nU4H8+j9OZMpalx5CHSmJ8Uqe4bwGhCKP9cZAePg3CHAFcIroNC3Gaob/yKQMTgaU\nRl4DOCguhUkLEINHnb/WVgOXTTyEXgx4dMFX0VO7W1h1yp92Znp2gjBU2vJPiDuD\nW9+9AINd1UxYmJ5k4evp\n=nJ1g\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T06:39:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commit/3a002279bb868e8633c7c75a1daba59bcd7bd589","node_id":"C_kwDOUsm60NoAKDNhMDAyMjc5YmI4NjhlODYzM2M3Yzc1YTFkYWJhNTliY2Q3YmQ1ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commit/02f7366b8006f91cdc1d59070e520c20f8e7590a","sha":"02f7366b8006f91cdc1d59070e520c20f8e7590a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/02f7366b8006f91cdc1d59070e520c20f8e7590a"}],"sha":"3a002279bb868e8633c7c75a1daba59bcd7bd589","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/3a002279bb868e8633c7c75a1daba59bcd7bd589"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71711553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney","id":71711553,"login":"JohnNooney","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/02f7366b8006f91cdc1d59070e520c20f8e7590a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:09:16Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:09:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Guest shell: App Check, anonymous sign-in, handshake, insights-panel skeleton (#26) (#39)\n\nThe Guest (Vue, apps/guest) is the Host''s iframe insights panel. Per #10 and\nBus v1:\n\n- initGuestFirebase: shared web-app config + unconditional initializeAppCheck\n  (reCAPTCHA Enterprise via the shared site key; debug token injected at\n  build time from KLARTEXT_GUEST_DEBUG_TOKEN) + Auth, emulator-connected\n  under VITE_USE_FIREBASE_EMULATORS. Firestore/Storage are never touched —\n  the anonymous uid has zero data access.\n- signInThenReady gates GUEST_READY on a resolved signInAnonymously(); a\n  Guest that can''t sign in never readies and the Host watchdog surfaces it.\n- createGuestBusAdapter: the real Guest-side adapter — exact targetOrigin,\n  event.origin + event.source allow-list, unknown types ignored; SESSION_ACK\n  echoes the sessionId; EXTRACT_DOCUMENT runs the injected runJob seam (#30\n  lands the Gemini client). Passes the shared conformance suite.\n- Peer Origin from document.referrer; standalone dev (window.parent ===\n  window) renders the golden fixture panel instead of wiring the Bus.\n- Insights-panel skeleton: document-type label, provenance line, plain-\n  English summary, warning-tinted \"Needs your attention\" cards for CRITICAL\n  Key Takeaways, then normal takeaways; neutral statusExplanation block for\n  non-COMPLETE Extractions. Tailwind on @klartext/theme tokens.\n- bus-contract exports isExtractionError (shared by adapters and the\n  loopback reference); firebase-config exposes the App Check site key.\n- e2e CI build sets VITE_USE_FIREBASE_EMULATORS; .env.example documents the\n  debug-token vars.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1858b5406a3904565dbe6e2f59506f78469b00a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/1858b5406a3904565dbe6e2f59506f78469b00a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/02f7366b8006f91cdc1d59070e520c20f8e7590a","verification":{"payload":"tree 1858b5406a3904565dbe6e2f59506f78469b00a5\nparent 5a05c6256ba5f194b16f83a81d02ee32e2c2c389\nauthor John Nooney <71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com> 1790514556 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790514556 +0100\n\nGuest shell: App Check, anonymous sign-in, handshake, insights-panel skeleton (#26) (#39)\n\nThe Guest (Vue, apps/guest) is the Host''s iframe insights panel. Per #10 and\nBus v1:\n\n- initGuestFirebase: shared web-app config + unconditional initializeAppCheck\n  (reCAPTCHA Enterprise via the shared site key; debug token injected at\n  build time from KLARTEXT_GUEST_DEBUG_TOKEN) + Auth, emulator-connected\n  under VITE_USE_FIREBASE_EMULATORS. Firestore/Storage are never touched —\n  the anonymous uid has zero data access.\n- signInThenReady gates GUEST_READY on a resolved signInAnonymously(); a\n  Guest that can''t sign in never readies and the Host watchdog surfaces it.\n- createGuestBusAdapter: the real Guest-side adapter — exact targetOrigin,\n  event.origin + event.source allow-list, unknown types ignored; SESSION_ACK\n  echoes the sessionId; EXTRACT_DOCUMENT runs the injected runJob seam (#30\n  lands the Gemini client). Passes the shared conformance suite.\n- Peer Origin from document.referrer; standalone dev (window.parent ===\n  window) renders the golden fixture panel instead of wiring the Bus.\n- Insights-panel skeleton: document-type label, provenance line, plain-\n  English summary, warning-tinted \"Needs your attention\" cards for CRITICAL\n  Key Takeaways, then normal takeaways; neutral statusExplanation block for\n  non-COMPLETE Extractions. Tailwind on @klartext/theme tokens.\n- bus-contract exports isExtractionError (shared by adapters and the\n  loopback reference); firebase-config exposes the App Check site key.\n- e2e CI build sets VITE_USE_FIREBASE_EMULATORS; .env.example documents the\n  debug-token vars.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquRV8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAA84QAEA+KXJqyLcwx+OI6U3QROQy\nJ7pwPxCGn1/foB7oCFJX2YuSLtUBP7RQZJ27cV6d2xVL+yXFoEemWWA/sKV7PjhX\ndK0uRiRaiK08S8ySIGTnLnZxKSOfc97YA/gttUtsewo0MfoNFQN2Hv15bjiaY267\niqGx1rw0UdW8MVwdD0U02uhayzul1KVHITGSIYAneiZrcuAn76g+LUZKulF/qief\nJud6oCPyzDniHRdJuyvUrTx8MLNuSGFtdPuK9qQwOiws2AdZ05/nXprvW4SLPkvJ\n4gy3S7WwBd1srs1nK7v/X9t8HvLu2PYzgGRThgGdQ1GXjqYoCQkj2t2YKh/KymmX\nhf5aqci0nji3m+agUcNmT32rYyWutK7pBXj6mzOkM3gZI2qdxhJ8kxzRWbkIuMoy\nS5pLAk3CHTg5EYBP4NQUY9OXUv0CLezikftI0gs1klUcbnCRAhQhnqgGegnmXgV0\nVWS9mOGVfqSsWp+TbfnD7YNQqcZCukfY938hqaHBHI9u+qWaic/Dv2DMz3b9PV05\nH/Zhk4GfL9y3WoQTl1rrlaTcCn284Qlhz8Q1WuJczmS6N4x2Y6iIgFzqm141XIbE\n9T8bMCU8SyGkk7Z6Tkw5JIWa8xrQofsGrEcCHeRvZCL/gJtG2CBUy