url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney","id":71711553,"login":"JohnNooney","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/5a05c6256ba5f194b16f83a81d02ee32e2c2c389/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:11:56Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:11:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Host shell: sign-in gate, app layout, Guest iframe mount, Bus adapter (#38)\n\n* Host shell: sign-in gate, app layout, Guest iframe mount, Bus adapter (#25)\n\nImplements the Host shell per issue #25: Firebase init with unconditional\nApp Check (debug token via config.local.json / CI-injected config.json,\nreCAPTCHA Enterprise key in prod), a full-screen sign-in gate (Google popup\nwith redirect fallback, Email/Password only under useEmulators), the\npost-auth sidebar/main layout, and the Guest iframe mounted once and kept\nhidden while signed in. The real Host Bus adapter binds window+contentWindow\nas BusSource/BusSink and passes the package conformance suite.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add recaptcha site key for production\n\n* Restrict prod sign-in to an email allowlist; enforce in rules\n\nallowedEmails in HostConfig gates the UX after auth; the real boundary\nis isAllowedUser() in firestore.rules/storage.rules — the owner''s email\nplus the emulator seed pinned to its fixed dev uid.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"adab623005068636df732ae406a204abfa579f8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/adab623005068636df732ae406a204abfa579f8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/5a05c6256ba5f194b16f83a81d02ee32e2c2c389","verification":{"payload":"tree adab623005068636df732ae406a204abfa579f8d\nparent 36354f237f5e991045e9146795762d2cad2bdb7b\nauthor John Nooney <71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com> 1790511116 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790511116 +0100\n\nHost shell: sign-in gate, app layout, Guest iframe mount, Bus adapter (#38)\n\n* Host shell: sign-in gate, app layout, Guest iframe mount, Bus adapter (#25)\n\nImplements the Host shell per issue #25: Firebase init with unconditional\nApp Check (debug token via config.local.json / CI-injected config.json,\nreCAPTCHA Enterprise key in prod), a full-screen sign-in gate (Google popup\nwith redirect fallback, Email/Password only under useEmulators), the\npost-auth sidebar/main layout, and the Guest iframe mounted once and kept\nhidden while signed in. The real Host Bus adapter binds window+contentWindow\nas BusSource/BusSink and passes the package conformance suite.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add recaptcha site key for production\n\n* Restrict prod sign-in to an email allowlist; enforce in rules\n\nallowedEmails in HostConfig gates the UX after auth; the real boundary\nis isAllowedUser() in firestore.rules/storage.rules — the owner''s email\nplus the emulator seed pinned to its fixed dev uid.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquQgMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbaYQAI136SiFug4e/DdQ6g7H73pR\nQ41jsw4COwXU1T1gEmLje1ehICNd/L6BwBN1e15863azpzAjuPe7rPaOhNATHKu8\nAzxDbu81dFL+eFFlJFzLE20lcnTmGkA+9plIjDxGcQvdF3nee7P93BQ7bPoIN050\ntuCC3t0ZAZUNVj8xi7/9UdHtVwQwYgNf8a/GhKejYMwo+e3P45T5/DL8l8UX6s5Q\nefwLMPVx9wBpFYwJJIHFQq8U1KC8/PN8OWNQol8zRdf0rnwNcnzzbbJI7wjG7yHB\nKrEXN2WBjlO3HHSWyA/4HyWACyiNqzm4ISxTFMn6CGUNooi2Er+HccX8GAM2+9Fb\nH/wGyRTggZjbnGAY1PSsQ9IUSFqCDQDM5NQgZCH6sNarSumpEmKgWcp9TDPX1/U6\n+65PGhD9sC0zdgXkXg+kuePUMAN9gHGCEpLM3ZymS0x6OW6bGfZvRtHm4lqjZ5jC\n1Oyx+HM9++iyDzue+NTTwC/FgjhETySXe/Q7o7JoRBrOiJi1cZ78Tvq1iP4+l+aL\n5hF+gCJ3nm/4iI3AgfM6L1LLwnT1GdpHP/vz8mEML8ezTbEwY7ezoThWHVWIHQqT\nOA8avdQdxAbT71DbtnTRRkUx5uXhT3u3NCE48b/liOjDmNQdoG4afmlak2BzCafp\nvAvse9do8gXg9vUjfkpY\n=licE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T12:11:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commit/5a05c6256ba5f194b16f83a81d02ee32e2c2c389","node_id":"C_kwDOUsm60NoAKDVhMDVjNjI1NmJhNWYxOTRiMTZmODNhODFkMDJlZTMyZTJjMmMzODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commit/36354f237f5e991045e9146795762d2cad2bdb7b","sha":"36354f237f5e991045e9146795762d2cad2bdb7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/36354f237f5e991045e9146795762d2cad2bdb7b"}],"sha":"5a05c6256ba5f194b16f83a81d02ee32e2c2c389","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/5a05c6256ba5f194b16f83a81d02ee32e2c2c389"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71711553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney","id":71711553,"login":"JohnNooney","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/36354f237f5e991045e9146795762d2cad2bdb7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T10:45:38Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T10:45:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Implement @klartext/bus-contract: Envelope types, harness, fixtures, conformance suite (#37)\n\nShared v1 contract per #7 as amended and the test surface per #13:\ndiscriminated BusMessage union on `type`, Session/Extraction-Job payloads,\nExtraction types verbatim from #8, and the typed error codes.\nserializeEnvelope/deserializeEnvelope are the reference JSON codec\n(EXTRACT_DOCUMENT bytes are base64), with one golden fixture per message\ntype that both apps now round-trip in their own Vitest. testing.ts ships\ncreateLinkedBusPair() — in-memory source/sink endpoints with postMessage\nsemantics (sync delivery, origin/source stamping, real transfer detach) —\nplus loopback reference adapters; conformance.ts exports\nrunBusContractConformance() covering handshake, stored-Extraction Sessions,\njob lifecycle, queueing, retries, Guest reload recovery, stale\nsessionId/jobId discard, all three watchdogs, and the codified rule that\nunknown types are ignored.\n\nHost tsconfigs pin rootDir to the repo root so source-level path mapping\ninto packages/ typechecks (keeps the explicit TS6-era pin).\n\nImplements #24\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf54ee9b1f23baca49d25215f2343248185fa08d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/cf54ee9b1f23baca49d25215f2343248185fa08d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/36354f237f5e991045e9146795762d2cad2bdb7b","verification":{"payload":"tree cf54ee9b1f23baca49d25215f2343248185fa08d\nparent 8810798c0ba75e6f5083db1a2e19a3a58526a12d\nauthor John Nooney <71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com> 1790505938 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790505938 +0100\n\nImplement @klartext/bus-contract: Envelope types, harness, fixtures, conformance suite (#37)\n\nShared v1 contract per #7 as amended and the test surface per #13:\ndiscriminated BusMessage union on `type`, Session/Extraction-Job payloads,\nExtraction types verbatim from #8, and the typed error codes.\nserializeEnvelope/deserializeEnvelope are the reference JSON codec\n(EXTRACT_DOCUMENT bytes are base64), with one golden fixture per message\ntype that both apps now round-trip in their own Vitest. testing.ts ships\ncreateLinkedBusPair() — in-memory source/sink endpoints with postMessage\nsemantics (sync delivery, origin/source stamping, real transfer detach) —\nplus loopback reference adapters; conformance.ts exports\nrunBusContractConformance() covering handshake, stored-Extraction Sessions,\njob lifecycle, queueing, retries, Guest reload recovery, stale\nsessionId/jobId discard, all three watchdogs, and the codified rule that\nunknown types are ignored.\n\nHost tsconfigs pin rootDir to the repo root so source-level path mapping\ninto packages/ typechecks (keeps the explicit TS6-era pin).\n\nImplements #24\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquPPSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAViEQABAOHzGTTA0ojYK7zrVpSfSi\nK+nGk2f0VUNUAtgwB9l7PU2HwvhQqpT+MSzJ49mf7bsPIXws0LKW6ShcO8nrMnU2\ngdPZz3qctSzRbpCyCqvowd38SKs0lq28SYogHoFnERYZJJuHc+aNhLml/KlxqfZ1\nvm4nq5GcoIzpNkimfmG99t2awdCv7Xtk3agg1ZjLEizmAYUkPdQzsyOx4+hsAztm\n9h/105OD4CzqKTMVDb5z7E8RKJqV3hJ4oMPRvFi+m2zp6tC3ceao5DmRfWyDIBbr\npriTx30r6394S2iXkrBAs6cZAxRqAkbICQQ+95jxYN+6uHHBF8KQtb+kUeblPEOl\nj4Es/ER5y18tlmu/MPkdRPsa/vKh2BaKfL9lzeTXrQabe6UXZf+gzOqft3IGgymR\nRt+ZyDW3OJ29USJwwb/4zS35CwfCHh3aE6OlsdQvfCwbtTy2AzAU7kllpxEdIIvP\nsegiQI2/Qj/Mtqch6r6HFGN7x819QII1dGSj5hO81Vru5rCD6yknI4BFvU7qkQpt\ngom/ryZcUPtNfunyWQmStQwtnQzx//p5QNabugnWoAl6r5vBLoaHCd+x2dfrszAk\nZDlOzkd8vVbiYCeU3s/moLC6rleuobHgSfid0fxup5de0IMp8FYfGkxugAhBj6WG\nnnTSYk/zp+xw/G9RG3UI\n=Ry+Z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verifi