"html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney","id":71711553,"login":"JohnNooney","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/8810798c0ba75e6f5083db1a2e19a3a58526a12d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:21:31Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:21:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix merge deploy targets: storage rules deploy via `storage` (#36)\n\n`storage:rules` isn''t a valid --only target (storage has no named\nsub-targets like firestore:rules); the CLI resolved it as a target\nnamed \"rules\" and failed while resolving the default bucket. Verified\nend-to-end: firebase deploy --only \"hosting,firestore:rules,storage\"\nwith owner credentials released both rules files and went live on both\nsites.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"48bf7f2b9276a15ad21f78844644154bc7f84a94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/48bf7f2b9276a15ad21f78844644154bc7f84a94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/8810798c0ba75e6f5083db1a2e19a3a58526a12d","verification":{"payload":"tree 48bf7f2b9276a15ad21f78844644154bc7f84a94\nparent 7fc44fb4127e30d671853b4e38a61b3701e3f7fa\nauthor John Nooney <71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com> 1790500891 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790500891 +0100\n\nFix merge deploy targets: storage rules deploy via `storage` (#36)\n\n`storage:rules` isn''t a valid --only target (storage has no named\nsub-targets like firestore:rules); the CLI resolved it as a target\nnamed \"rules\" and failed while resolving the default bucket. Verified\nend-to-end: firebase deploy --only \"hosting,firestore:rules,storage\"\nwith owner credentials released both rules files and went live on both\nsites.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquOAbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbkMQAFmuYg7cUeTUzHTfT9Xf+NM3\nmQm9mPI/hjQIdA7YKRCSitFzHbADZ76RVgZr5VFKg2cfAo6mQeQqk1ruLorfXQtE\nTi8006XxeH6GtaxQfDF2L43A3jtcOWx0Tj7NdYcNuTGnS1KbHkSKrJSxUmyNBVCa\nYB9gbHLeV66MH2kPrbkzZW99LmaTB5kjPFXOG4qe/5szhNdYYtHVPA9IpGAkPMbJ\n7qDSS3Vt7wGOAauBkBHx55UZy9krGHJnrDozGEZPwbZXO/cm0edLPR6JWjn12XOb\nN0+Y80rhe/EmR7NuReRrkrnho23EwWOWzO7p4WVQQrPGJhIxgw4ODpByqhWBDcL2\nPUrfLo33i/vepG3aUT+oADs4yIxxPWypqXGHA43lzLK+SiE4Wb/gCm4jw8Il+zhl\nvdmc2WNMXiflGTCuJIuGDnv7Ckgo1KyBwaLPG8AxM0fnENqh5XA7vyjcU7yI9C7q\n6+Uspr9/FfsRR66IMGeHaM10Jj0JmsFth2bT/XaCLdLDvz5zgaoXqcbxyd1Ggwur\n2Ni0V1JQPsjFk2B8IiWzKMht0/nwFlOTRjRdWEnswMX7iAfpS/+5zWT40S+bpjMY\n6+9MuuyzYTh20lFTvVyZnfhtoAlHJvnjfZAg93hbTH98JPRDFYuo8c5AcbmbymuK\nAnT6KnNi8Nop2Gev/J0P\n=o09w\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T09:21:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commit/8810798c0ba75e6f5083db1a2e19a3a58526a12d","node_id":"C_kwDOUsm60NoAKDg4MTA3OThjMGJhNzVlNmY1MDgzZGIxYTJlMTlhM2E1ODUyNmExMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commit/7fc44fb4127e30d671853b4e38a61b3701e3f7fa","sha":"7fc44fb4127e30d671853b4e38a61b3701e3f7fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/7fc44fb4127e30d671853b4e38a61b3701e3f7fa"}],"sha":"8810798c0ba75e6f5083db1a2e19a3a58526a12d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/8810798c0ba75e6f5083db1a2e19a3a58526a12d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71711553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney","id":71711553,"login":"JohnNooney","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/7fc44fb4127e30d671853b4e38a61b3701e3f7fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T08:24:32Z","email":"71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T08:24:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Wire CI gates, Guest-first PR preview channels, and live deploy (#35)\n\n* Wire CI gates, Guest-first PR preview channels, and live deploy\n\nThree gate jobs in a reusable workflow shared by the PR and merge\npipelines: checks (lint seam + typecheck + unit tests),\nrules+integration (emulators:exec over the seed and per-package\ntest:integration suites as they land), and a build-only e2e\nplaceholder until #34. PRs deploy the Guest preview channel first so\nits hashed origin can be written into the Host''s config.json before\nthe Host builds; merges rerun the gates then deploy both sites and the\nFirestore/Storage rules. App Check debug tokens are wired as env in\nnon-production jobs only, ready for #25/#26.\n\nImplements #23\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Bump workspace to Node 24 and declare seed''s google-cloud deps\n\njsdom@30 (guest) requires Node ^22.22.2/^24.15/>=26 and\nfirebase-admin@14 requires >=22 — the Node 20 pin let pnpm install\nthem but the deps couldn''t actually run, surfacing as a vitest worker\ncrash and pnpm skipping firebase-admin''s optional @google-cloud\npackages in CI. Node 24 LTS satisfies the whole tree. Declaring\n@google-cloud/firestore and @google-cloud/storage directly keeps the\nseed working regardless of optional-dependency evaluation.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a3d465e773a8b0682b429c795293353fa7cf39f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/7a3d465e773a8b0682b429c795293353fa7cf39f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/7fc44fb4127e30d671853b4e38a61b3701e3f7fa","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a3d465e773a8b0682b429c795293353fa7cf39f\nparent 25198d43fecff3abdb4185223c0c8fd1d3aa7402\nauthor John Nooney <71711553+JohnNooney@users.noreply.github.com> 1790497472 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790497472 +0100\n\nWire CI gates, Guest-first PR preview channels, and live deploy (#35)\n\n* Wire CI gates, Guest-first PR preview channels, and live deploy\n\nThree gate jobs in a reusable workflow shared by the PR and merge\npipelines: checks (lint seam + typecheck + unit tests),\nrules+integration (emulators:exec over the seed and per-package\ntest:integration suites as they land), and a build-only e2e\nplaceholder until #34. PRs deploy the Guest preview channel first so\nits hashed origin can be written into the Host''s config.json before\nthe Host builds; merges rerun the gates then deploy both sites and the\nFirestore/Storage rules. App Check debug tokens are wired as env in\nnon-production jobs only, ready for #25/#26.\n\nImplements #23\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Bump workspace to Node 24 and declare seed''s google-cloud deps\n\njsdom@30 (guest) requires Node ^22.22.2/^24.15/>=26 and\nfirebase-admin@14 requires >=22 — the Node 20 pin let pnpm install\nthem but the deps couldn''t actually run, surfacing as a vitest worker\ncrash and pnpm skipping firebase-admin''s optional @google-cloud\npackages in CI. Node 24 LTS satisfies the whole tree. Declaring\n@google-cloud/firestore and @google-cloud/storage directly keeps the\nseed working regardless of optional-dependency ev