wing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney","id":71711553,"login":"JohnNooney","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/commits/94a6d0c000c260c9f4302568286b1a0a6b670552/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:54:29Z","email":"johnnoon74@gmail.com","name":"John Nooney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:54:29Z","email":"johnnoon74@gmail.com","name":"John Nooney"},"message":"Scaffold the pnpm workspace, both apps, and the emulator harness\n\nIssue #22: pnpm workspace with apps/host (Angular 21 — newest major that\nstill supports the pinned Node 20 LTS; Angular 22 requires >=22.22),\napps/guest (Vue 3 + Vite + Tailwind 4 + Vitest), and packages/{theme,\nbus-contract,firebase-config} consumed via source-level path mapping with\nno build step.\n\n- packages/theme ports the settled Apple-style tokens from\n  prototype/ui-host-guest as tokens.css, with an SCSS alias layer for the\n  Host and a Tailwind @theme mapping for the Guest.\n- firebase.json gains the two-site Hosting array (host/guest targets,\n  SPA rewrites, ADR 0004 frame-ancestors CSPs) and the emulator suite;\n  firebase.json/.firebaserc are un-ignored so the config is committed.\n- scripts/seed.mjs seeds the demo Auth user, the prototype Folder tree,\n  and three fixture Documents (two with stored Extractions matching the\n  fake-provider fixtures); the committed emulator-data/ snapshot is loaded\n  via emulators:start --import.\n- Host fetches assets/config.json before bootstrap and mounts the Guest\n  iframe; committed dev config points at http://localhost:5173, with a\n  production variant alongside.\n- storage.rules: fix invalid {documentId}.pdf partial-segment wildcard\n  (rejected by the rules runtime) with an equivalent full-segment match +\n  .pdf filename check.\n\nRefs #22\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a640e16f631409aa4ed9ec54db14a3217bf9c16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/trees/3a640e16f631409aa4ed9ec54db14a3217bf9c16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JohnNooney/KlartextDMS/git/commits/94a6d0c000c260c9f4302568286b1a0a6b670552","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71711553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JohnNooney","id":71711553,"login":"JohnNooney","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzExNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnNooney","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https